(2399381, 330794, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s well composed and the background is nice, however your score will suffer because of the colour.  The whole image has a blue shade to it.  If you need help understanding how to correct this whitebalance issue just send me a message - its really quite easy to do.</td>', 'It''s well composed and the background is nice, however your score will suffer because of the colour.  The whole image has a blue shade to it.  If you need help understanding how to correct this whitebalance issue just send me a message - its really quite easy to do.', '2006-05-10 02:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399388, 332212, 39349, '<td valign="top">I wish you had taken a half step to the right, then the stair case would be lined up perfectly. Beyond that this is a VERY beautiful photo, the only thing I see that bothers me is the blown out clouds on the right side of the frame.</td>', 'I wish you had taken a half step to the right, then the stair case would be lined up perfectly. Beyond that this is a VERY beautiful photo, the only thing I see that bothers me is the blown out clouds on the right side of the frame.', '2006-05-10 02:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
