(2399398, 332319, 1647, '<td valign="top">Highest score so far from me.  Why?  The colour is lovely and rich and the inclusion of people really brings it to life.  It''s a lovely looking church and you have captured it well.</td>', 'Highest score so far from me.  Why?  The colour is lovely and rich and the inclusion of people really brings it to life.  It''s a lovely looking church and you have captured it well.', '2006-05-10 02:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
