(2399481, 332224, 1647, '<td valign="top">If you got this image without violating the basic editing rules (ie: selective editing) then well done.  I love the title and idea for this image.</td>', 'If you got this image without violating the basic editing rules (ie: selective editing) then well done.  I love the title and idea for this image.', '2006-05-10 02:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399487, 331493, 1647, '<td valign="top">The image is great although the border (in my opinion) does nothing to add to the picture and would probably be better left out.  The simplicity of colour and shape really make the picture easy to look at and the people give the statue a lovely sense of scale.</td>', 'The image is great although the border (in my opinion) does nothing to add to the picture and would probably be better left out.  The simplicity of colour and shape really make the picture easy to look at and the people give the statue a lovely sense of scale.', '2006-05-10 02:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399492, 331186, 57525, '<td valign="top">and I thought the Europeans had the edge with cathedrals... Absolutely beautiful!  Great detail, great pic! 9/10... would have been a 10 if the very top of the tower wasn''t cut off</td>', 'and I thought the Europeans had the edge with cathedrals... Absolutely beautiful!  Great detail, great pic! 9/10... would have been a 10 if the very top of the tower wasn''t cut off', '2006-05-10 02:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399499, 332449, 1647, '<td valign="top">Sorry - this looks a like like a case of trying to use a title to make the image fit a challenge.  Ignoring that, its a great photo that I''m sure would look good blown up on canvas.  You''ll suffer for not really meeting the challenge in the eyes of a lot of people though so don''t think the score reflects the quality of the photo in general.</td>', 'Sorry - this looks a like like a case of trying to use a title to make the image fit a challenge.  Ignoring that, its a great photo that I''m sure would look good blown up on canvas.  You''ll suffer for not really meeting the challenge in the eyes of a lot of people though so don''t think the score reflects the quality of the photo in general.', '2006-05-10 02:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399505, 332277, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the pillars are so bright and dominant that they detract from the crypt itself a little.  Perhaps a different view / perspective could have been chosen to make the image more interesting.</td>', 'Unfortunately the pillars are so bright and dominant that they detract from the crypt itself a little.  Perhaps a different view / perspective could have been chosen to make the image more interesting.', '2006-05-10 02:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399508, 332474, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of orientation / perspective - its something quite different for this type of ceiling shot.</td>', 'I like your choice of orientation / perspective - its something quite different for this type of ceiling shot.', '2006-05-10 02:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399510, 330269, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very lovely shot... bet those dresses need a good cleaning though :-P</td>', 'Very lovely shot... bet those dresses need a good cleaning though :-P', '2006-05-10 02:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399547, 332190, 57525, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between old and new.  Very clever shot!</td>', 'I love the contrast between old and new.  Very clever shot!', '2006-05-10 02:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399551, 332455, 4767, '<td valign="top">Think I might have said a few words of gratitude very near there, myself!  Gorgeous capture of the light!</td>', 'Think I might have said a few words of gratitude very near there, myself!  Gorgeous capture of the light!', '2006-05-10 02:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399559, 331669, 4767, '<td valign="top">I understand the journey to epiphany can sometimes be a long one.  THIS is worth whatever you had to go through, imho.  Excellent exosure, unique subject.  Those Anasazi had a view while they meditated, I think.</td>', 'I understand the journey to epiphany can sometimes be a long one.  THIS is worth whatever you had to go through, imho.  Excellent exosure, unique subject.  Those Anasazi had a view while they meditated, I think.', '2006-05-10 02:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2399566, 330122, 57775, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overexposed.  Like the composition though.</td>', 'Seems a little overexposed.  Like the composition though.', '2006-05-10 02:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
