(2399580, 332438, 57775, '<td valign="top">I love the architecture, but I think the building loses some of its power by having too many distracting elements around.  I think I would''ve liked it more if the photo were cropped in much closer around the church.  Still like it though - 7 from me.</td>', 'I love the architecture, but I think the building loses some of its power by having too many distracting elements around.  I think I would''ve liked it more if the photo were cropped in much closer around the church.  Still like it though - 7 from me.', '2006-05-10 02:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
