(2401252, 330417, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good job of locating this angle for your image.  Well done in spotting this.  Nice color and exposure on this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good job of locating this angle for your image.  Well done in spotting this.  Nice color and exposure on this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-05-10 13:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
