(2401260, 329971, 54728, '<td valign="top">love the TVs, made me chuckle</td>', 'love the TVs, made me chuckle', '2006-05-10 13:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401262, 332028, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this for it''s simplicity.  Nice lines in the composition.  The repeating pattern with the windows works well.  Borders are usually a give or take with me.  In this case a border might have helped to "contain" the image some.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this for it''s simplicity.  Nice lines in the composition.  The repeating pattern with the windows works well.  Borders are usually a give or take with me.  In this case a border might have helped to "contain" the image some.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-05-10 13:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401265, 329567, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice rich tones and an interesting perspective/angle.  I like the way you''ve put this together.</td>', 'Nice rich tones and an interesting perspective/angle.  I like the way you''ve put this together.', '2006-05-10 13:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401271, 332483, 54728, '<td valign="top">oh, I love this.  Very urban.  Light trails are cool.  The weird perspective makes it very dynamic, as do all the lights.</td>', 'oh, I love this.  Very urban.  Light trails are cool.  The weird perspective makes it very dynamic, as do all the lights.', '2006-05-10 13:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401274, 331412, 49773, '<td valign="top">A little bit grainy, try using Neat Image. <a href="//www.neatimage.com/download.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">download NI</a> <br/>Interesting composition,btw.</td>', 'A little bit grainy, try using Neat Image. download NI Interesting composition,btw.', '2006-05-10 13:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401278, 331663, 49773, '<td valign="top">I appreciate this taken as holy place.Interesting approach.</td>', 'I appreciate this taken as holy place.Interesting approach.', '2006-05-10 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401279, 331178, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image.  It makes me wonder how you got the shot.  Did the subject know you were taking his photo?  Not that it matters, just curious.  One thing that might have helped the composition of this would be to crop the left off some, all the way into the subject''s back.  The chair and people in the back left are distracting and by taking a little off the left you would move your subject to an off-center position.  JMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice image.  It makes me wonder how you got the shot.  Did the subject know you were taking his photo?  Not that it matters, just curious.  One thing that might have helped the composition of this would be to crop the left off some, all the way into the subject''s back.  The chair and people in the back left are distracting and by taking a little off the left you would move your subject to an off-center position.  JMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-05-10 13:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401280, 332212, 7969, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, but i think it needs to be rotated bit to the left, looks like it is crooked</td>', 'very nice shot, but i think it needs to be rotated bit to the left, looks like it is crooked', '2006-05-10 13:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401283, 330595, 49773, '<td valign="top">This is the utmostly intersting idea. Great image!</td>', 'This is the utmostly intersting idea. Great image!', '2006-05-10 13:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401313, 332324, 57712, '<td valign="top">I really like the mixed color of light. The blue and yellow are very complimentary. It''s a classic shot!</td>', 'I really like the mixed color of light. The blue and yellow are very complimentary. It''s a classic shot!', '2006-05-10 13:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401385, 332275, 57712, '<td valign="top">The white borders on being overexposed, the grass seems to be overly saturated, the cross is in an interesting place between his legs (hehe), and I like the inclusion of the bird since he was likely the one that left the evidence on top of the guy. It''s a little over the top processed but I like it!</td>', 'The white borders on being overexposed, the grass seems to be overly saturated, the cross is in an interesting place between his legs (hehe), and I like the inclusion of the bird since he was likely the one that left the evidence on top of the guy. It''s a little over the top processed but I like it!', '2006-05-10 13:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401393, 332350, 57712, '<td valign="top">The soft lighting really makes this image. There seems to be a lot of different lines that are competing for perspective and so it seems a little distorted but the mood comes over great.</td>', 'The soft lighting really makes this image. There seems to be a lot of different lines that are competing for perspective and so it seems a little distorted but the mood comes over great.', '2006-05-10 13:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401396, 331389, 57712, '<td valign="top">At first it seems a little busy but I like how only the one headstone has details, it really makes it stand out and makes me concentrate on just that.</td>', 'At first it seems a little busy but I like how only the one headstone has details, it really makes it stand out and makes me concentrate on just that.', '2006-05-10 13:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401402, 330631, 57712, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and angle. She has such a peaceful look on her face.</td>', 'Nice lighting and angle. She has such a peaceful look on her face.', '2006-05-10 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401422, 331961, 57712, '<td valign="top">I think the focus is a little off on this because it almost seems like the rocks behind the cross are in focus more than anything else. I like the composition though.</td>', 'I think the focus is a little off on this because it almost seems like the rocks behind the cross are in focus more than anything else. I like the composition though.', '2006-05-10 13:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401429, 331939, 57712, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better without the stray leaf. The warm colors of the light compliment the green of the plant nicely.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better without the stray leaf. The warm colors of the light compliment the green of the plant nicely.', '2006-05-10 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401433, 330730, 57712, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the colors almost seemed washed out. The lighting looks a little flat too.</td>', 'I like the composition but the colors almost seemed washed out. The lighting looks a little flat too.', '2006-05-10 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
