(2401703, 331860, 56797, '<td valign="top">odd lighting. so bright on the left so dark on the right. more even lighting would have helped this alot. nice composition though</td>', 'odd lighting. so bright on the left so dark on the right. more even lighting would have helped this alot. nice composition though', '2006-05-10 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401710, 330957, 56797, '<td valign="top">the sideways headstone in the middle is so distracting, and it seems like its all focused on the left side then cut down the middle and out of focus on the right. odd. love the left side, not so much the right. 6</td>', 'the sideways headstone in the middle is so distracting, and it seems like its all focused on the left side then cut down the middle and out of focus on the right. odd. love the left side, not so much the right. 6', '2006-05-10 14:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401714, 332342, 43774, '<td valign="top">It''s too posed, I prefer more natural/candid photos of people. However, you did get the placement good with the statue of Christ behind him.</td>', 'It''s too posed, I prefer more natural/candid photos of people. However, you did get the placement good with the statue of Christ behind him.', '2006-05-10 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401719, 332234, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice blue sky, architecture is perhaps too simple to be attractive or appealing</td>', 'Nice blue sky, architecture is perhaps too simple to be attractive or appealing', '2006-05-10 14:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401724, 331738, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building, shame it was not a nicer day. I think a blue sky would relly set this off, or at least an interesting sky with clouds to add dimension.</td>', 'Beautiful building, shame it was not a nicer day. I think a blue sky would relly set this off, or at least an interesting sky with clouds to add dimension.', '2006-05-10 14:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401728, 332028, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it is slightly out of focus or if it''s the post processing creating that effect. The textures are nice but it is sort of a bland photo with not a lot of interest.</td>', 'Not sure if it is slightly out of focus or if it''s the post processing creating that effect. The textures are nice but it is sort of a bland photo with not a lot of interest.', '2006-05-10 14:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401731, 331964, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the composition with the door open and seeing the over exposed areas outside. Perhaps if you had focused more on the stained glass window it would be more interesting.</td>', 'Not sure I like the composition with the door open and seeing the over exposed areas outside. Perhaps if you had focused more on the stained glass window it would be more interesting.', '2006-05-10 14:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401738, 330387, 39993, '<td valign="top">Like the distorted view, perspective and colours.</td>', 'Like the distorted view, perspective and colours.', '2006-05-10 14:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401739, 330584, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice looking church but the inclusion of the "playground" (not sure what that brightly coloured area is) doesn''t work. It''s a cluttered area that doesn''t add to the feeling of the big stone church.</td>', 'Nice looking church but the inclusion of the "playground" (not sure what that brightly coloured area is) doesn''t work. It''s a cluttered area that doesn''t add to the feeling of the big stone church.', '2006-05-10 14:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401742, 331828, 43774, '<td valign="top">A bit dull, needs to be brightened up.</td>', 'A bit dull, needs to be brightened up.', '2006-05-10 14:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401743, 332314, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love the subject, but wish the sky hadn''t been blown.  It would have bumped this up into the 8-10 range.  As is, I''ll give it a 7 for the unique subject and nice duotone.</td>', 'I love the subject, but wish the sky hadn''t been blown.  It would have bumped this up into the 8-10 range.  As is, I''ll give it a 7 for the unique subject and nice duotone.', '2006-05-10 14:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401750, 332483, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo! I like your title, but I would have liked the photo better without the bus....maybe if you used a longer shutter speed and just caught the light trail it would be less distracting.</td>', 'Interesting photo! I like your title, but I would have liked the photo better without the bus....maybe if you used a longer shutter speed and just caught the light trail it would be less distracting.', '2006-05-10 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401751, 330775, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think it needs some more contrast.  Quite symmetrical.  I can''t decide if that is good or bad. 5</td>', 'I think it needs some more contrast.  Quite symmetrical.  I can''t decide if that is good or bad. 5', '2006-05-10 14:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401754, 331446, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice idea using the rainbow to highlight the bible. But the photo seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Nice idea using the rainbow to highlight the bible. But the photo seems slightly out of focus.', '2006-05-10 14:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401758, 331852, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo seems slightly out of focus. I might have focused closer on the ruins to highlight the textures and shapes</td>', 'Photo seems slightly out of focus. I might have focused closer on the ruins to highlight the textures and shapes', '2006-05-10 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401760, 332204, 56797, '<td valign="top">pretty noisy/grainy and im so distracted by the skull in the back and the weird smudging its hard to focus on the point of the picture. what is that foggy/smudgey/condensation looking stuff right under the skull? and theres a backpack behind the preists head thats annoying too. maybe i just have a short attention span and cant focus though.</td>', 'pretty noisy/grainy and im so distracted by the skull in the back and the weird smudging its hard to focus on the point of the picture. what is that foggy/smudgey/condensation looking stuff right under the skull? and theres a backpack behind the preists head thats annoying too. maybe i just have a short attention span and cant focus though.', '2006-05-10 14:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401763, 332400, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, ok, I was going to actually enter a nature shot if I had entered so don''t think I''m DNMC for that. BUT, "holy" should mean "set apart" and I was looking for nature shots which would be quite different from a typical shot.  The shot itself is nicely composed and I like the bright flower.  The blurred object in the background is nicely abstract.  Ok, I''ll give it to you as that sorta looks like a spirit and that''s what I''m guessing you were hinting at with the title.  So the good and the bad are going to balance and you get a 5.</td>', 'Hmmm, ok, I was going to actually enter a nature shot if I had entered so don''t think I''m DNMC for that. BUT, "holy" should mean "set apart" and I was looking for nature shots which would be quite different from a typical shot.  The shot itself is nicely composed and I like the bright flower.  The blurred object in the background is nicely abstract.  Ok, I''ll give it to you as that sorta looks like a spirit and that''s what I''m guessing you were hinting at with the title.  So the good and the bad are going to balance and you get a 5.', '2006-05-10 14:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401771, 331997, 40718, '<td valign="top">Blown sky. :( symmetric shot. :( dull colors. :( that''s tough.  Well, people say they like to know why people vote low. 4.</td>', 'Blown sky. :( symmetric shot. :( dull colors. :( that''s tough.  Well, people say they like to know why people vote low. 4.', '2006-05-10 15:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
