(2401776, 330613, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the border.  The shot itself is nicely balanced with the swan and person in prayer.  I''m not quite sure this is a holy place as much as a holy person.  The colors are somewhat drab.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the border.  The shot itself is nicely balanced with the swan and person in prayer.  I''m not quite sure this is a holy place as much as a holy person.  The colors are somewhat drab.', '2006-05-10 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
