(2402132, 330417, 31307, '<td valign="top">Was the grain intentional?  I think that it works against the subject and feeling of this shot.  Other than that though, darn fine work .  Nice saturation.  I would have been tempted to over saturate this were it mine, but I think you made the right decision and kept a sort of "cold steel" tone to the image.  Again, darn fine work.</td>', 'Was the grain intentional?  I think that it works against the subject and feeling of this shot.  Other than that though, darn fine work .  Nice saturation.  I would have been tempted to over saturate this were it mine, but I think you made the right decision and kept a sort of "cold steel" tone to the image.  Again, darn fine work.', '2006-05-10 16:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
