(2402150, 331501, 31307, '<td valign="top">Image is a little right-leaning--horizon could have been straighter.  <br/> <br/>Is it critical that the viewer sees the trees and driveway?  Perhaps you could try a tighter crop that focused more on the contrasting colors between the sky and temple.  Blue and silver/light gray are a fantastic color combination--one of my favorites.  The dark green also goes well with the gray, but I feel like it pulls attention away from where the strength of the image lies.<br/> <br/>Nice saturation.</td>', 'Image is a little right-leaning--horizon could have been straighter.   Is it critical that the viewer sees the trees and driveway?  Perhaps you could try a tighter crop that focused more on the contrasting colors between the sky and temple.  Blue and silver/light gray are a fantastic color combination--one of my favorites.  The dark green also goes well with the gray, but I feel like it pulls attention away from where the strength of the image lies. Nice saturation.', '2006-05-10 16:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
