(2402181, 331670, 56987, '<td valign="top">Ani Ohev HaTemunah Hazeh. Atah/At Gar/a BeYerushaliem? Ani Gar Poeh. I like your Pic it realy captures the essence of the Kotel.</td>', 'Ani Ohev HaTemunah Hazeh. Atah/At Gar/a BeYerushaliem? Ani Gar Poeh. I like your Pic it realy captures the essence of the Kotel.', '2006-05-10 16:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2402183, 330387, 31307, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of wide angle lens but not sure you needed to go that extreme.    Perhaps a 28-30 mm lens would have been a better choice?  I don''t know.  The light on the right is a little overpowering and pulls the attention away from what should be the focus of the piece.  One of the things a fisheye does is make the viewer''s eye want to move around the entire image more and the highlights on the right fight that.</td>', 'Interesting use of wide angle lens but not sure you needed to go that extreme.    Perhaps a 28-30 mm lens would have been a better choice?  I don''t know.  The light on the right is a little overpowering and pulls the attention away from what should be the focus of the piece.  One of the things a fisheye does is make the viewer''s eye want to move around the entire image more and the highlights on the right fight that.', '2006-05-10 16:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2402184, 331677, 52336, '<td valign="top">The sky is rather blown, and the position and prominence of the tree forces the eye away from the subject, I think.</td>', 'The sky is rather blown, and the position and prominence of the tree forces the eye away from the subject, I think.', '2006-05-10 16:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
