(2403143, 332299, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing of the temple. I like how the sun makes a star through the trees. Seems a little too contrasty though.</td>', 'Very nice framing of the temple. I like how the sun makes a star through the trees. Seems a little too contrasty though.', '2006-05-10 19:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403145, 330169, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow this is excellent.  Great capture.</td>', 'Wow this is excellent.  Great capture.', '2006-05-10 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403147, 332249, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and surroundings for the church. I wish the mountain/sky line were not so centered, it just seems to cut the photo in two.</td>', 'Nice sky and surroundings for the church. I wish the mountain/sky line were not so centered, it just seems to cut the photo in two.', '2006-05-10 19:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403148, 330517, 57839, '<td valign="top">Absolutely awesome</td>', 'Absolutely awesome', '2006-05-10 19:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403150, 331600, 56673, '<td valign="top">Tough photo to grade.  It is certainly "holy" but doesn''t give a real sense of a "place."  Technically, very well done.  As a still life I''d probably give a 6 or 7, but as a Holy Place I voted "5".</td>', 'Tough photo to grade.  It is certainly "holy" but doesn''t give a real sense of a "place."  Technically, very well done.  As a still life I''d probably give a 6 or 7, but as a Holy Place I voted "5".', '2006-05-10 19:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403151, 330417, 57839, '<td valign="top">Incredible lighting and composition!</td>', 'Incredible lighting and composition!', '2006-05-10 19:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403152, 331138, 57839, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, exposure, and composition</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, exposure, and composition', '2006-05-10 19:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403153, 332449, 56673, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch as a Holy Place, in my view.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch as a Holy Place, in my view.', '2006-05-10 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403154, 331588, 57839, '<td valign="top">Love the colors &amp; composition</td>', 'Love the colors & composition', '2006-05-10 19:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403157, 332013, 57839, '<td valign="top">Inspiring shot</td>', 'Inspiring shot', '2006-05-10 19:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403164, 331971, 56673, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Not cute enough to move my vote, but cute.</td>', 'Cute.  Not cute enough to move my vote, but cute.', '2006-05-10 19:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403166, 332003, 56673, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic!</td>', 'Very dramatic!', '2006-05-10 19:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403171, 332289, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is a bit of a bland photo, sorry. The architecture is not amazing, the sky is grey and dull. Perhaps a better angle would help, getting closer to the church and shooting up towards the steeple might be more interesting. There are several specks of dirt in the sky, too, time to clean your camera.</td>', 'This is a bit of a bland photo, sorry. The architecture is not amazing, the sky is grey and dull. Perhaps a better angle would help, getting closer to the church and shooting up towards the steeple might be more interesting. There are several specks of dirt in the sky, too, time to clean your camera.', '2006-05-10 19:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403176, 332308, 56673, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would have looked like shot from the inside during the day, with the light bursting through the stained glass?  As it is, a bit dark and blurry.</td>', 'I wonder what this would have looked like shot from the inside during the day, with the light bursting through the stained glass?  As it is, a bit dark and blurry.', '2006-05-10 19:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403179, 332062, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like your framing of this but the photo doesn''t seem to be in focus. I also wish you had tried to come up with a title. "Untitled" seems like a cop-out to me.</td>', 'I really like your framing of this but the photo doesn''t seem to be in focus. I also wish you had tried to come up with a title. "Untitled" seems like a cop-out to me.', '2006-05-10 19:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403180, 332324, 56673, '<td valign="top">Oh my, isn''t this a striking shot!?  Very well framed, terrific colors.</td>', 'Oh my, isn''t this a striking shot!?  Very well framed, terrific colors.', '2006-05-10 19:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403184, 331361, 43774, '<td valign="top">I wish there were more of interest in this photo. A person''s hand reaching out towards one of the names, an interesting reflection in the stone, something to give it more feeling.</td>', 'I wish there were more of interest in this photo. A person''s hand reaching out towards one of the names, an interesting reflection in the stone, something to give it more feeling.', '2006-05-10 19:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403187, 329864, 56673, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Well done.  It is hard to capture the grandeur of these large spaces, but you did it well.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Well done.  It is hard to capture the grandeur of these large spaces, but you did it well.', '2006-05-10 19:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403193, 330800, 43774, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice looking building but your photo needs some improvements. It is tilted slightly to the right and it seems washed out. A polarizing filter would help, or adjusting the contrast.</td>', 'That''s a nice looking building but your photo needs some improvements. It is tilted slightly to the right and it seems washed out. A polarizing filter would help, or adjusting the contrast.', '2006-05-10 19:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403197, 332022, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you took this from. It does seem a bit washed out, though, and not quite as sharp as I would like to see.</td>', 'I like the angle you took this from. It does seem a bit washed out, though, and not quite as sharp as I would like to see.', '2006-05-10 19:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403201, 332460, 56673, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific picture that is close to being amazing.  Not sure what you can do in basic editing (I''m still learning) but the cross and foreground are maybe a bit too dark, and the jagged edges on the cross detract a bit.</td>', 'This is a terrific picture that is close to being amazing.  Not sure what you can do in basic editing (I''m still learning) but the cross and foreground are maybe a bit too dark, and the jagged edges on the cross detract a bit.', '2006-05-10 19:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403205, 332281, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is it spelled "More" or "Moore"? Image is a little too centered for my tastes.</td>', 'Is it spelled "More" or "Moore"? Image is a little too centered for my tastes.', '2006-05-10 19:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403207, 331508, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice building, photo seems a little washed out, needs more contrast</td>', 'Nice building, photo seems a little washed out, needs more contrast', '2006-05-10 19:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403214, 331856, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking church, shame the sky is so bland and washed out.</td>', 'Interesting looking church, shame the sky is so bland and washed out.', '2006-05-10 19:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403216, 332204, 56673, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this!  The setting, the characters, the lighting all are terrific.  I give it an "8" (for me that''s very high).</td>', 'I really, really like this!  The setting, the characters, the lighting all are terrific.  I give it an "8" (for me that''s very high).', '2006-05-10 19:34:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2403227, 331603, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the significance of this photo or how it fits this challenge. Is the marble a tomb or headstone? If it is, you should have showed more of it so we could see that and relate this to the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t get the significance of this photo or how it fits this challenge. Is the marble a tomb or headstone? If it is, you should have showed more of it so we could see that and relate this to the theme of the challenge.', '2006-05-10 19:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403232, 331857, 43774, '<td valign="top">I believe I''ve been in that church. :) The altar area is very busy and dark, the ceiling is so beautiful, though, of course I am going to say you should have focused more on the ceiling.</td>', 'I believe I''ve been in that church. :) The altar area is very busy and dark, the ceiling is so beautiful, though, of course I am going to say you should have focused more on the ceiling.', '2006-05-10 19:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403237, 331669, 43774, '<td valign="top">Amazing scenery, I would love to visit that area. There are a lot of dirt specks in the sky that I just cannot overlook, though.</td>', 'Amazing scenery, I would love to visit that area. There are a lot of dirt specks in the sky that I just cannot overlook, though.', '2006-05-10 19:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403241, 331748, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo is too centered and looks chopped off at the bottom. Perhaps a different angle would work.</td>', 'Photo is too centered and looks chopped off at the bottom. Perhaps a different angle would work.', '2006-05-10 19:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403244, 331964, 56673, '<td valign="top">That is a hard shot to expose correctly, and it may just be a bit overexposed still.</td>', 'That is a hard shot to expose correctly, and it may just be a bit overexposed still.', '2006-05-10 19:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403247, 331514, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and shapes, good clear blue sky to set it off. But your photo is not that big and there seems to be a lot of compression artifacts. You should try saving at a better compression rate.</td>', 'Nice lines and shapes, good clear blue sky to set it off. But your photo is not that big and there seems to be a lot of compression artifacts. You should try saving at a better compression rate.', '2006-05-10 19:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403250, 332487, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good rich colours, I like that you off-set the cross.</td>', 'Very nice, good rich colours, I like that you off-set the cross.', '2006-05-10 19:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403253, 331502, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lovely place. Your photo is washed out, though.</td>', 'Looks like a lovely place. Your photo is washed out, though.', '2006-05-10 19:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403257, 332349, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interetsing take on the challenge theme as it specified holy "places". I wish it were in better focus and I really wish you hadn''t cut off the end of the instrument.</td>', 'Interetsing take on the challenge theme as it specified holy "places". I wish it were in better focus and I really wish you hadn''t cut off the end of the instrument.', '2006-05-10 19:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403258, 331561, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, different than most in the challenge. I think B&amp;W works well for you here. I wish the top of the cross were not cut off.</td>', 'Interesting photo, different than most in the challenge. I think B&W works well for you here. I wish the top of the cross were not cut off.', '2006-05-10 19:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403260, 330269, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. A little too centered for my tastes, but the colour is good.</td>', 'Interesting photo. A little too centered for my tastes, but the colour is good.', '2006-05-10 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403261, 331591, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines and shapes, simple and not cluttered.</td>', 'Nice clean lines and shapes, simple and not cluttered.', '2006-05-10 19:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403265, 332129, 56673, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You nailed this one.  Color, lighting, DOF, perspective all terrific.  Really captures a mood.  I give it an "8".</td>', 'Wow!  You nailed this one.  Color, lighting, DOF, perspective all terrific.  Really captures a mood.  I give it an "8".', '2006-05-10 19:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403266, 332358, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not quite in focus, but lucky for you to capture lightning by the church for this challenge!</td>', 'Not quite in focus, but lucky for you to capture lightning by the church for this challenge!', '2006-05-10 19:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403267, 329510, 43774, '<td valign="top">You seem to have had problems saving your photo at a good compression rate. Very pixelated and fuzzy.</td>', 'You seem to have had problems saving your photo at a good compression rate. Very pixelated and fuzzy.', '2006-05-10 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403269, 332062, 56673, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to read the back story on this one.</td>', 'I can''t wait to read the back story on this one.', '2006-05-10 19:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403270, 332362, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful church, I wonder if a more straight on shot would work better than this angled one.</td>', 'Beautiful church, I wonder if a more straight on shot would work better than this angled one.', '2006-05-10 19:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403273, 332275, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s bright! Looks good though.</td>', 'Wow that''s bright! Looks good though.', '2006-05-10 19:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403275, 332472, 43774, '<td valign="top">Shame about those flagpoles because I think they''re really distracting. Nice blue lights in the windows of the church, good night photo.</td>', 'Shame about those flagpoles because I think they''re really distracting. Nice blue lights in the windows of the church, good night photo.', '2006-05-10 19:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403277, 330843, 56673, '<td valign="top">For me, just too far away, with nothing going on in the foreground to justify the long view.</td>', 'For me, just too far away, with nothing going on in the foreground to justify the long view.', '2006-05-10 19:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403278, 329865, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good job on catching the reflection in the water. Your photo is tilted to the left though and that is really distracting.</td>', 'Good job on catching the reflection in the water. Your photo is tilted to the left though and that is really distracting.', '2006-05-10 19:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403282, 329954, 43774, '<td valign="top">Amazing sky!</td>', 'Amazing sky!', '2006-05-10 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403286, 332400, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like this, it''s beautiful. Some might think it is a stretch to fit it into the challenge and I am not fully convinced it fits here either, but it''s a beautiful photo.</td>', 'I really like this, it''s beautiful. Some might think it is a stretch to fit it into the challenge and I am not fully convinced it fits here either, but it''s a beautiful photo.', '2006-05-10 19:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403287, 332217, 56673, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  But the tops of the buildings are blurry and the overall image lacks crispness.  "5".</td>', 'I like the idea.  But the tops of the buildings are blurry and the overall image lacks crispness.  "5".', '2006-05-10 19:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403288, 331177, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright!</td>', 'Nice and bright!', '2006-05-10 19:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403292, 329635, 43774, '<td valign="top">I would have tried to capture this at a different time of day. The shadow cuts right across the church and the sky is washed out</td>', 'I would have tried to capture this at a different time of day. The shadow cuts right across the church and the sky is washed out', '2006-05-10 19:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403293, 330417, 58615, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I love the reflection in the water and I like how small the puddle is too. Well done.</td>', 'This is a great photo. I love the reflection in the water and I like how small the puddle is too. Well done.', '2006-05-10 19:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403294, 331092, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this fits the challenge and I don''t see what the title has to do with the photo, sorry.</td>', 'I don''t see how this fits the challenge and I don''t see what the title has to do with the photo, sorry.', '2006-05-10 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403295, 332013, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but it doesn''t seem to be quite in focus</td>', 'Nice composition but it doesn''t seem to be quite in focus', '2006-05-10 19:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403296, 331130, 56673, '<td valign="top">Mount Olympus is a wonderful setting, but this shot seems to me to be missing a focal point or a clear subject.</td>', 'Mount Olympus is a wonderful setting, but this shot seems to me to be missing a focal point or a clear subject.', '2006-05-10 19:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403298, 331376, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is not in focus. Shame, because it looks like an amazing place.</td>', 'This is not in focus. Shame, because it looks like an amazing place.', '2006-05-10 19:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403299, 332446, 58615, '<td valign="top">I love the colors. Wonderful job, the shadows work well with it as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the colors. Wonderful job, the shadows work well with it as well. Nicely done.', '2006-05-10 19:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403302, 331186, 56673, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!  Makes my shots looks sooo lame.</td>', 'Breathtaking!  Makes my shots looks sooo lame.', '2006-05-10 19:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403309, 332460, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice beam of light, is that cross as big as it looks? Because it looks huge! Lighting is a bit dull, you might want to try brightening it up.</td>', 'Nice beam of light, is that cross as big as it looks? Because it looks huge! Lighting is a bit dull, you might want to try brightening it up.', '2006-05-10 19:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403311, 330837, 56673, '<td valign="top">Purple sky, backlit, glare, shadows.  Seems like a lot more could have been done with this subject.</td>', 'Purple sky, backlit, glare, shadows.  Seems like a lot more could have been done with this subject.', '2006-05-10 19:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403313, 332110, 56673, '<td valign="top">You can just feel this village clinging to the edge of the land, trying not to slip into the sea. (Or is it a lake?)</td>', 'You can just feel this village clinging to the edge of the land, trying not to slip into the sea. (Or is it a lake?)', '2006-05-10 19:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403315, 332286, 43774, '<td valign="top">Funny, if the challenge were "holey places" instead of "holy places". Would work well in a humour challenge. I do like the beams of light in the background.</td>', 'Funny, if the challenge were "holey places" instead of "holy places". Would work well in a humour challenge. I do like the beams of light in the background.', '2006-05-10 19:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403320, 331961, 43774, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE the composition and the subject matter but your photo is not in focus! Even sharpening in photoshop would help.</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE the composition and the subject matter but your photo is not in focus! Even sharpening in photoshop would help.', '2006-05-10 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403323, 330173, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo doesn''t appear to be in focus.</td>', 'Photo doesn''t appear to be in focus.', '2006-05-10 19:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403327, 329777, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this fits the challenge. There is a bridge just like that in one of our local parks, I don''t see anything special or holy about it.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this fits the challenge. There is a bridge just like that in one of our local parks, I don''t see anything special or holy about it.', '2006-05-10 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403328, 332121, 54728, '<td valign="top">nice, but horizon needs to be fixed.</td>', 'nice, but horizon needs to be fixed.', '2006-05-10 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403330, 331670, 56673, '<td valign="top">Great subject, and it looks like the time of day would have made for a great image.  Too bad about the blur walking in front of your camera during the shot.</td>', 'Great subject, and it looks like the time of day would have made for a great image.  Too bad about the blur walking in front of your camera during the shot.', '2006-05-10 19:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403332, 331956, 43774, '<td valign="top">The challenge is "holy places", not "holey places". This is a poor attempt at humour and it didn''t work.</td>', 'The challenge is "holy places", not "holey places". This is a poor attempt at humour and it didn''t work.', '2006-05-10 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403340, 332190, 54728, '<td valign="top">hey look! it''s the tower of Babel.  Wow, that building really looks tall, and as if it will fall over.  interesting persective.  Though I don''t really like the glaring brightness of the old building in comparison.  It must be difficult though, to get the exposure right.</td>', 'hey look! it''s the tower of Babel.  Wow, that building really looks tall, and as if it will fall over.  interesting persective.  Though I don''t really like the glaring brightness of the old building in comparison.  It must be difficult though, to get the exposure right.', '2006-05-10 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403341, 332470, 56673, '<td valign="top">Ha ha.  "2"</td>', 'Ha ha.  "2"', '2006-05-10 20:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403365, 332218, 56673, '<td valign="top">That is a fantastic shot.  But because they are Navy aircraft, you''ll have to be marked down.  Just kidding - bit of a stretch for Holy Places?</td>', 'That is a fantastic shot.  But because they are Navy aircraft, you''ll have to be marked down.  Just kidding - bit of a stretch for Holy Places?', '2006-05-10 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403366, 332212, 54728, '<td valign="top">nicely centered</td>', 'nicely centered', '2006-05-10 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403393, 331738, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very sharp! 9 from me</td>', 'Very sharp! 9 from me', '2006-05-10 20:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403395, 332013, 18655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - crisp and good colors - 9 from me</td>', 'Beautiful - crisp and good colors - 9 from me', '2006-05-10 20:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403399, 332104, 38496, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines.  I might have liked it a little more with only the pipes, and not all the buttons at the bottom.</td>', 'Interesting lines.  I might have liked it a little more with only the pipes, and not all the buttons at the bottom.', '2006-05-10 20:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403402, 331700, 18655, '<td valign="top">I love this! Beautiful - crisp and good colors. I love how you included the flowers in the foreground. 10 from me, hands down</td>', 'I love this! Beautiful - crisp and good colors. I love how you included the flowers in the foreground. 10 from me, hands down', '2006-05-10 20:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403408, 330053, 18655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - crisp and the red stands out well - 7 from me</td>', 'Beautiful - crisp and the red stands out well - 7 from me', '2006-05-10 20:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403410, 331857, 38496, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  It''s sometimes tricky to get interiors lit nicely, and you did well this.</td>', 'Nice shot.  It''s sometimes tricky to get interiors lit nicely, and you did well this.', '2006-05-10 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403411, 331038, 18655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - crisp and good colors - 9 from me</td>', 'Beautiful - crisp and good colors - 9 from me', '2006-05-10 20:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403416, 331860, 38496, '<td valign="top">definately Holy Ground.  Nice idea.  The shadow to the right throws the composition off balance somewhat.</td>', 'definately Holy Ground.  Nice idea.  The shadow to the right throws the composition off balance somewhat.', '2006-05-10 20:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403418, 332203, 56673, '<td valign="top">This is a technically terrific shot, but I''ll admit I don''t get the "Holy Places" connection?</td>', 'This is a technically terrific shot, but I''ll admit I don''t get the "Holy Places" connection?', '2006-05-10 20:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403421, 331701, 18655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - crisp and good colors - 7 from me</td>', 'Beautiful - crisp and good colors - 7 from me', '2006-05-10 20:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403422, 331670, 38496, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  The only thing that doesn''t work for me is the person right in the front.  It''s fairly distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  The only thing that doesn''t work for me is the person right in the front.  It''s fairly distracting.', '2006-05-10 20:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403424, 331663, 18655, '<td valign="top">Interesting view on the challenge, but I''ll buy it - 8 from me</td>', 'Interesting view on the challenge, but I''ll buy it - 8 from me', '2006-05-10 20:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403426, 331870, 38496, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The color seems a little off - the sky is sort of green looking.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The color seems a little off - the sky is sort of green looking.', '2006-05-10 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403429, 332362, 56673, '<td valign="top">Good color, just a bit too dark.</td>', 'Good color, just a bit too dark.', '2006-05-10 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
