(2404606, 332228, 55642, '<td valign="top">The sky is so blown out that it''s actually impinging on the sides of the tower. I''m not crazy about the angle, and it looks like one of the pinnacles on the tower might be cut off just a teensy bit? I would try to take this photo again earlier in the day when the light isn''t so harsh, allow more space at the top of the frame, and maybe try to emphasis less the entire building and more some of the more interesting architectural details, like the texture of the brickwork, the height of the tower, the shape of the doors and windows, etc.</td>', 'The sky is so blown out that it''s actually impinging on the sides of the tower. I''m not crazy about the angle, and it looks like one of the pinnacles on the tower might be cut off just a teensy bit? I would try to take this photo again earlier in the day when the light isn''t so harsh, allow more space at the top of the frame, and maybe try to emphasis less the entire building and more some of the more interesting architectural details, like the texture of the brickwork, the height of the tower, the shape of the doors and windows, etc.', '2006-05-11 01:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404612, 331810, 55642, '<td valign="top">It''s too dark, and it''s not clear what I''m looking at, other than a lit crucifix. What is it standing over? It''s also a bit unfortunate that light floodlights also light part of the trees behind it, since they distract focus from your subject. I might crop this tighter to get less dead space.</td>', 'It''s too dark, and it''s not clear what I''m looking at, other than a lit crucifix. What is it standing over? It''s also a bit unfortunate that light floodlights also light part of the trees behind it, since they distract focus from your subject. I might crop this tighter to get less dead space.', '2006-05-11 01:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404615, 331092, 55642, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo, but I would classify this more as a study of a thing than a place. What makes a daffodil holy? This idea isn''t made clear through the photo.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo, but I would classify this more as a study of a thing than a place. What makes a daffodil holy? This idea isn''t made clear through the photo.', '2006-05-11 01:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404620, 331748, 55642, '<td valign="top">I think the choice to center the bell tower actually hurts this photo, since it leaves so much dead space off to the right. Perhaps moving it to the right would also help it fit better into the rule of thirds?</td>', 'I think the choice to center the bell tower actually hurts this photo, since it leaves so much dead space off to the right. Perhaps moving it to the right would also help it fit better into the rule of thirds?', '2006-05-11 01:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404622, 331738, 55642, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate that the weather didn''t give you a nice sunny blue sky for this photo. I sympathize, but it makes the whole thing look dreary.</td>', 'It''s unfortunate that the weather didn''t give you a nice sunny blue sky for this photo. I sympathize, but it makes the whole thing look dreary.', '2006-05-11 01:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404623, 330320, 55642, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, but too out of focus.</td>', 'Lovely idea, but too out of focus.', '2006-05-11 01:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404627, 331722, 55642, '<td valign="top">Ooh, nice idea. I like the color, and the cherub has nice definition, though he''s a little blown out.</td>', 'Ooh, nice idea. I like the color, and the cherub has nice definition, though he''s a little blown out.', '2006-05-11 01:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404631, 331750, 55642, '<td valign="top">I think my only criticism here is that I would like to see this shot more perfectly centered. The center line of the pews makes the photo look tilted, even though it''s not.</td>', 'I think my only criticism here is that I would like to see this shot more perfectly centered. The center line of the pews makes the photo look tilted, even though it''s not.', '2006-05-11 01:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404633, 332201, 55642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. One criticism, and that is the wall line in the upper left corner. The way the light hits it highlights it a little too much. Either a burn to deemphasize it (though illegal for this challenge) or a crop to remove it would help focus the photo on your intended subjects.</td>', 'Beautiful. One criticism, and that is the wall line in the upper left corner. The way the light hits it highlights it a little too much. Either a burn to deemphasize it (though illegal for this challenge) or a crop to remove it would help focus the photo on your intended subjects.', '2006-05-11 01:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404635, 330245, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, gorgeous detail. I like that this is a detail shot instead of a straightforward church pic. I would make the center line run perfectly straight up and down and expand the width to include those small portions of the knockers that were cropped out.</td>', 'Nice clarity, gorgeous detail. I like that this is a detail shot instead of a straightforward church pic. I would make the center line run perfectly straight up and down and expand the width to include those small portions of the knockers that were cropped out.', '2006-05-11 01:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404638, 332460, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting place by the looks of it, though I wish there were more light on the cross.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting place by the looks of it, though I wish there were more light on the cross.', '2006-05-11 01:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404639, 332294, 55642, '<td valign="top">Ignoring the fact that a nun is not a "place", the photo is just way too blown out.</td>', 'Ignoring the fact that a nun is not a "place", the photo is just way too blown out.', '2006-05-11 01:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404655, 330794, 55642, '<td valign="top">There is far too much blue here. Something about the color adjustment has also made the sky a greenish turquoise.</td>', 'There is far too much blue here. Something about the color adjustment has also made the sky a greenish turquoise.', '2006-05-11 02:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404669, 332204, 51918, '<td valign="top">I love the subject, the faces are so expressive.  The lighting is a bit off but a great photo.</td>', 'I love the subject, the faces are so expressive.  The lighting is a bit off but a great photo.', '2006-05-11 02:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404683, 331177, 55642, '<td valign="top">As much as I like color, this actually looks oversaturated, even to me.</td>', 'As much as I like color, this actually looks oversaturated, even to me.', '2006-05-11 02:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404690, 331446, 44086, '<td valign="top">I know this is the Bible but the angle of shot leaves it looking more like a newspaper. You lost all the depth of a book by not including the sides of the pages. Also, the text which is the focal point is out of focus. Keep shooting. I do like the subject matter.</td>', 'I know this is the Bible but the angle of shot leaves it looking more like a newspaper. You lost all the depth of a book by not including the sides of the pages. Also, the text which is the focal point is out of focus. Keep shooting. I do like the subject matter.', '2006-05-11 02:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404698, 330387, 44086, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the fisheye look.  IMHO it looses the immensity of the cathedral</td>', 'Don''t like the fisheye look.  IMHO it looses the immensity of the cathedral', '2006-05-11 02:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404719, 332478, 55642, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, but the challenge is supposed to be a holy <i>place</i>, not a person.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, but the challenge is supposed to be a holy place, not a person.', '2006-05-11 02:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404724, 332351, 58122, '<td valign="top">love Man O'' War-friend owns a thoroughbred related to him.  Great horse-great pic!</td>', 'love Man O'' War-friend owns a thoroughbred related to him.  Great horse-great pic!', '2006-05-11 02:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404742, 331190, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hah, nice. I actually like the minimalist approach to this one. The gold shines out from the gray quite nicely! Perhaps a tiny sliver of a crop should be made to the very bottom to remove the bump in the middle.</td>', 'Hah, nice. I actually like the minimalist approach to this one. The gold shines out from the gray quite nicely! Perhaps a tiny sliver of a crop should be made to the very bottom to remove the bump in the middle.', '2006-05-11 02:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404772, 332202, 40952, '<td valign="top">Very nice..I love the tones..such a peaceful setting 9.</td>', 'Very nice..I love the tones..such a peaceful setting 9.', '2006-05-11 02:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404777, 332324, 40952, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great framing and composition.</td>', 'Very nice. Great framing and composition.', '2006-05-11 02:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404803, 332229, 49315, '<td valign="top">I like this greta potential but the image quality doesnt seem right? It looks very weird when i look at it I also love how the trees draw your eyes to the building.</td>', 'I like this greta potential but the image quality doesnt seem right? It looks very weird when i look at it I also love how the trees draw your eyes to the building.', '2006-05-11 03:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404805, 332123, 49315, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful and capivating picture, 10!</td>', 'This is a beautiful and capivating picture, 10!', '2006-05-11 03:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404824, 330517, 49315, '<td valign="top">I dont know why I like this but I do, 10!</td>', 'I dont know why I like this but I do, 10!', '2006-05-11 03:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404875, 332199, 57525, '<td valign="top">haha, nice play on words.</td>', 'haha, nice play on words.', '2006-05-11 03:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404887, 332404, 57525, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and giant sky.</td>', 'I really like the composition and giant sky.', '2006-05-11 03:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404910, 331614, 57525, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful photo.  If this was a landscape challenge, I would give a 10, but it''s not, so the best I can do is 6.  Sorry...</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful photo.  If this was a landscape challenge, I would give a 10, but it''s not, so the best I can do is 6.  Sorry...', '2006-05-11 03:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404921, 329865, 43681, '<td valign="top">nice the reflection</td>', 'nice the reflection', '2006-05-11 03:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404924, 330423, 43681, '<td valign="top">It don''t look perfect straight !</td>', 'It don''t look perfect straight !', '2006-05-11 03:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404927, 332446, 43681, '<td valign="top">Little dark</td>', 'Little dark', '2006-05-11 03:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404929, 330517, 43681, '<td valign="top">Very original</td>', 'Very original', '2006-05-11 03:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404931, 332470, 57525, '<td valign="top">I knew there would be at least one of these.  the colors are awesome.  great photo.</td>', 'I knew there would be at least one of these.  the colors are awesome.  great photo.', '2006-05-11 03:51:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2405030, 332289, 52439, '<td valign="top">Just alittle dull for me.<br/>Nice composition and focus though.</td>', 'Just alittle dull for me.Nice composition and focus though.', '2006-05-11 05:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405031, 330517, 53668, '<td valign="top">One of the most interesting photo''s in the whole challenge.</td>', 'One of the most interesting photo''s in the whole challenge.', '2006-05-11 05:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405032, 332218, 52439, '<td valign="top">Good shot, even the aerfoils coming off the wings.<br/>I don''t i get how it matches the challenge however.</td>', 'Good shot, even the aerfoils coming off the wings.I don''t i get how it matches the challenge however.', '2006-05-11 05:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405033, 330797, 52439, '<td valign="top">Good focus and interesting perspective.</td>', 'Good focus and interesting perspective.', '2006-05-11 05:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405034, 331446, 52439, '<td valign="top">Love the lights effect.</td>', 'Love the lights effect.', '2006-05-11 05:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405035, 332217, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, like the haze effect, or difused glow, whichever it is.</td>', 'Nice shot, like the haze effect, or difused glow, whichever it is.', '2006-05-11 05:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405036, 332241, 52439, '<td valign="top">Poor subject choice, it doesn''t interest me, the light is harsh aswell.</td>', 'Poor subject choice, it doesn''t interest me, the light is harsh aswell.', '2006-05-11 05:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405037, 330613, 52439, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, not keen on the border though.</td>', 'Not a bad photo, not keen on the border though.', '2006-05-11 05:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405038, 332076, 52439, '<td valign="top">Good atmospheric shot.</td>', 'Good atmospheric shot.', '2006-05-11 05:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405039, 332478, 53668, '<td valign="top">A winner for me.  Just gorgeous...</td>', 'A winner for me.  Just gorgeous...', '2006-05-11 05:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405040, 331404, 52439, '<td valign="top">Good shot, love the golden spotlighting.</td>', 'Good shot, love the golden spotlighting.', '2006-05-11 05:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405050, 332489, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good shot and fits the challenge well.  I''m just concerned about the dark marks on the left side.  They may be clouds, but with the rest of the sky looking blown out, they look more like smudges of some kind to me.  A shame, because the overall composition is good.</td>', 'This is a pretty good shot and fits the challenge well.  I''m just concerned about the dark marks on the left side.  They may be clouds, but with the rest of the sky looking blown out, they look more like smudges of some kind to me.  A shame, because the overall composition is good.', '2006-05-11 05:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405055, 331579, 44611, '<td valign="top">A good perspective and composition, but the rather harsh contrast between the bright sky in the centre of the image and the shadowy left hand corner of the building detracts from this image too much for me.</td>', 'A good perspective and composition, but the rather harsh contrast between the bright sky in the centre of the image and the shadowy left hand corner of the building detracts from this image too much for me.', '2006-05-11 05:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405059, 331748, 44611, '<td valign="top">Missions offer such a great opportunity for photography - particularly those situated where blue skies abound such as this.  I think, however, had you taken this from a different perspective it might have had more impact.</td>', 'Missions offer such a great opportunity for photography - particularly those situated where blue skies abound such as this.  I think, however, had you taken this from a different perspective it might have had more impact.', '2006-05-11 05:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405062, 332241, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good title and I think you had a great idea here.  The lighting hasn''t done you any favours though and I perhaps would have liked to have seen a greater dof to avoid the distraction of the pews in the background.</td>', 'Good title and I think you had a great idea here.  The lighting hasn''t done you any favours though and I perhaps would have liked to have seen a greater dof to avoid the distraction of the pews in the background.', '2006-05-11 05:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405064, 332483, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good title, great treatment and creative approach.  The two glare spots are rather distracting - the lamp on the lhs definitely - you probably could get away with the one in the doorway on the right.  One of the better images in this challenge though, imho.</td>', 'Good title, great treatment and creative approach.  The two glare spots are rather distracting - the lamp on the lhs definitely - you probably could get away with the one in the doorway on the right.  One of the better images in this challenge though, imho.', '2006-05-11 05:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405066, 332062, 44611, '<td valign="top">Fascinating place, captured well through the frame.</td>', 'Fascinating place, captured well through the frame.', '2006-05-11 05:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405068, 332013, 44611, '<td valign="top">I do like the simplicity of this shot very much, but feel that a different crop would have helped the composition a bit.  Shame too that you''ve lost some detail from that front parapet panel due to the highlights being blown out.   Still one of my higher scoring shots in this challenge.</td>', 'I do like the simplicity of this shot very much, but feel that a different crop would have helped the composition a bit.  Shame too that you''ve lost some detail from that front parapet panel due to the highlights being blown out.   Still one of my higher scoring shots in this challenge.', '2006-05-11 06:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405071, 332478, 44611, '<td valign="top">Cute girl with such a lovely expression.  Beautiful portrait shot.</td>', 'Cute girl with such a lovely expression.  Beautiful portrait shot.', '2006-05-11 06:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405074, 330343, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is potentially absolutlely wonderful.  I love the different types of stone and the lines created by the coloumns and arches.  But, and I''m sorry there has to be a but, the perspective looks wonky to me, it seems to tip to the left - and being so critical to the view that''s really bothering me.  Great entry though.</td>', 'This is potentially absolutlely wonderful.  I love the different types of stone and the lines created by the coloumns and arches.  But, and I''m sorry there has to be a but, the perspective looks wonky to me, it seems to tip to the left - and being so critical to the view that''s really bothering me.  Great entry though.', '2006-05-11 06:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405076, 331493, 44611, '<td valign="top">Not strictly holy, just Britain''s largest sculpture.  The composition here is good and I particularly like the silhouetted figures looking at the sculpture - ''specially the man on the bike!  But the frame does it no justice at all - in fact it detracts strongly from my enjoyment of this shot.</td>', 'Not strictly holy, just Britain''s largest sculpture.  The composition here is good and I particularly like the silhouetted figures looking at the sculpture - ''specially the man on the bike!  But the frame does it no justice at all - in fact it detracts strongly from my enjoyment of this shot.', '2006-05-11 06:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405078, 331669, 44611, '<td valign="top">Quite a view - and thank you for enhancing my knowledge bank!  I had to Google Kiva to figure out what it was.</td>', 'Quite a view - and thank you for enhancing my knowledge bank!  I had to Google Kiva to figure out what it was.', '2006-05-11 06:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405082, 330122, 44611, '<td valign="top">A potentially great image and what a marvellous place of worship - deep in the trees.  Here the overall focus looks rather soft without there being one single thing in sharp enough focus to be the subject.  The exposure is also a bit too bright meaning that the contrast is not as good as it could be.</td>', 'A potentially great image and what a marvellous place of worship - deep in the trees.  Here the overall focus looks rather soft without there being one single thing in sharp enough focus to be the subject.  The exposure is also a bit too bright meaning that the contrast is not as good as it could be.', '2006-05-11 06:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405085, 330417, 44611, '<td valign="top">Amazing church and well caught reflection.</td>', 'Amazing church and well caught reflection.', '2006-05-11 06:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405092, 332110, 44611, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful place, very tranquil and serene indeed.  I''m guessing it''s not holy in it''s own right (like being a shrine or whatever), but nonetheless worthy of a decent score.</td>', 'What a beautiful place, very tranquil and serene indeed.  I''m guessing it''s not holy in it''s own right (like being a shrine or whatever), but nonetheless worthy of a decent score.', '2006-05-11 06:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405097, 331663, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great shot - dodgy challenge subject connection!  Worthy of a decent score though.</td>', 'Great shot - dodgy challenge subject connection!  Worthy of a decent score though.', '2006-05-11 06:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405098, 331469, 44611, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing place.  Looking forward to finding out where this is.</td>', 'What an intriguing place.  Looking forward to finding out where this is.', '2006-05-11 06:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405100, 331677, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - a shame that the highlights at the top are a bit blown.</td>', 'Lovely shot - a shame that the highlights at the top are a bit blown.', '2006-05-11 06:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405101, 331660, 44611, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this shot and if those clouds are natural they''re amazing.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this shot and if those clouds are natural they''re amazing.', '2006-05-11 06:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405109, 331178, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2006-05-11 06:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405140, 332299, 52675, '<td valign="top">I love the way you framed the temple with the trees and flowers making for an interesting story not just another picture of a church.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I love the way you framed the temple with the trees and flowers making for an interesting story not just another picture of a church.  Beautiful.', '2006-05-11 07:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405145, 331497, 52675, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for your title, but I love the picture. The softness and the eyes. I get the feeling she''s praying, not sleeping. Nice.</td>', 'I don''t care for your title, but I love the picture. The softness and the eyes. I get the feeling she''s praying, not sleeping. Nice.', '2006-05-11 07:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405147, 332006, 52675, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.</td>', 'I love the colors.', '2006-05-11 07:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405153, 330169, 52675, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-05-11 07:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405158, 331038, 52675, '<td valign="top">Nice, vibrant.  I think the picture would have more impact though with the yellow cropped from the bottom.</td>', 'Nice, vibrant.  I think the picture would have more impact though with the yellow cropped from the bottom.', '2006-05-11 07:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405163, 332478, 52675, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  I love the expression you caught.</td>', 'Wonderful.  I love the expression you caught.', '2006-05-11 07:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405191, 332294, 41554, '<td valign="top">"Ackkk! Argh! (*Choke*) What profanity is this that I see? Must be work of the devil!!!"<br/> <br/>LOL - that was, I am sure, the most common reaction to your pic. I like it!! Extra kudos for courage, submitting something like this here on DPC...</td>', '"Ackkk! Argh! (*Choke*) What profanity is this that I see? Must be work of the devil!!!" LOL - that was, I am sure, the most common reaction to your pic. I like it!! Extra kudos for courage, submitting something like this here on DPC...', '2006-05-11 07:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405236, 332028, 53668, '<td valign="top">When I first glanced at this, I thought someone was standing inside, behind the middle window....a bit spooky.  But on closer examination, I realized it was just the window on the other side of the church.<br/>lol - guess I need my glasses adjusted.</td>', 'When I first glanced at this, I thought someone was standing inside, behind the middle window....a bit spooky.  But on closer examination, I realized it was just the window on the other side of the church.lol - guess I need my glasses adjusted.', '2006-05-11 08:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405239, 332354, 9111, '<td valign="top">this would be much better with out the clutter inteh back of the room</td>', 'this would be much better with out the clutter inteh back of the room', '2006-05-11 08:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405249, 331412, 29748, '<td valign="top">nice, but seems a little grainy.</td>', 'nice, but seems a little grainy.', '2006-05-11 08:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405250, 332342, 29748, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2006-05-11 08:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405253, 331750, 56167, '<td valign="top">nice photo but would have liked to see more detail at front of chapel but that is only my opinion you still have my vote</td>', 'nice photo but would have liked to see more detail at front of chapel but that is only my opinion you still have my vote', '2006-05-11 08:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405255, 332129, 29748, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Simple and elegant.  good use of dof.</td>', 'Very nice.  Simple and elegant.  good use of dof.', '2006-05-11 08:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405256, 331890, 56167, '<td valign="top">would have liked to have seen more focus on the statues, looks more like a dream catcher but that is only my opinion</td>', 'would have liked to have seen more focus on the statues, looks more like a dream catcher but that is only my opinion', '2006-05-11 08:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405257, 330804, 29748, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2006-05-11 09:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405258, 331520, 29748, '<td valign="top">Good concept, ery unique.</td>', 'Good concept, ery unique.', '2006-05-11 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405259, 332299, 22939, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  Love the colours and the... hmm.. actually I love everything about it.. i had already voted 9 on this but I''m changing it to 10.  I think this photo belongs in the top 5.</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  Love the colours and the... hmm.. actually I love everything about it.. i had already voted 9 on this but I''m changing it to 10.  I think this photo belongs in the top 5.', '2006-05-11 09:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405261, 332076, 56167, '<td valign="top">would like to have seen more of the front than the seets as it looks very interesting, but it is difficult to get the light in these places</td>', 'would like to have seen more of the front than the seets as it looks very interesting, but it is difficult to get the light in these places', '2006-05-11 09:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405262, 331501, 29748, '<td valign="top">Good job here.  Perhaps cropping off some of the bottom to get rid of more of the grass??  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Good job here.  Perhaps cropping off some of the bottom to get rid of more of the grass??  Just my opinion.', '2006-05-11 09:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405264, 331770, 29748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Good colors, nice cropping.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Good colors, nice cropping.', '2006-05-11 09:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405265, 332348, 29748, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but It seems a litle unbalanced with the top angel having her wing and head slightly cropped off.</td>', 'Nice shot, but It seems a litle unbalanced with the top angel having her wing and head slightly cropped off.', '2006-05-11 09:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405266, 329801, 29748, '<td valign="top">Good use of dof.</td>', 'Good use of dof.', '2006-05-11 09:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405269, 331422, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-05-11 09:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
