(2405579, 332207, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it''s time to clean your keyboard.  The dirty keys actually add some other color to the mix and give it and old look.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, but it''s time to clean your keyboard.  The dirty keys actually add some other color to the mix and give it and old look.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 11:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405582, 332121, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The tops of the mosque look like they''re leaning to the left.  It would be nice to spot edit out the smoke stack, but that''s not allowed.  Maybe a different angle next time (of course, we don''t see whats on the right which might''ve been worse).</td>', 'Nice shot.  The tops of the mosque look like they''re leaning to the left.  It would be nice to spot edit out the smoke stack, but that''s not allowed.  Maybe a different angle next time (of course, we don''t see whats on the right which might''ve been worse).', '2006-05-11 11:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405584, 329635, 40580, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting doesn''t help and the signal is a little distracting.  Nice try tho.</td>', 'The harsh lighting doesn''t help and the signal is a little distracting.  Nice try tho.', '2006-05-11 11:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405592, 332400, 40580, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the execution, and the DOF.  Nice conversion to B&amp;W.  Great pic!</td>', 'I like the idea, the execution, and the DOF.  Nice conversion to B&W.  Great pic!', '2006-05-11 11:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405600, 332211, 40580, '<td valign="top">Oh, watch for those highlights.  Would be better with a little fill flash to get some more detail in the cofin.  Something should be done about the lighting too.  I like the idea of the light coming from the window, but that''s too much light.</td>', 'Oh, watch for those highlights.  Would be better with a little fill flash to get some more detail in the cofin.  Something should be done about the lighting too.  I like the idea of the light coming from the window, but that''s too much light.', '2006-05-11 11:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405602, 331501, 40580, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Not much to say about it.</td>', 'Well done.  Not much to say about it.', '2006-05-11 11:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405607, 331138, 40580, '<td valign="top">I hope this scores high.  I like the simplicity of the shot along with the colors.</td>', 'I hope this scores high.  I like the simplicity of the shot along with the colors.', '2006-05-11 11:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405611, 330804, 40580, '<td valign="top">Oh, another church picture.  Nothing unique.  Nice shot though.  It would be better without the distracting people.</td>', 'Oh, another church picture.  Nothing unique.  Nice shot though.  It would be better without the distracting people.', '2006-05-11 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405620, 331825, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice image in a verdant setting.  The tangled branches add something.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice image in a verdant setting.  The tangled branches add something.  Good work.', '2006-05-11 11:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405623, 332013, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.  Given the rules, I would have cloned out the small lightning conductor rod at the top of the cross.</td>', 'Simple and effective.  Given the rules, I would have cloned out the small lightning conductor rod at the top of the cross.', '2006-05-11 11:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405624, 330440, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and nice composition.</td>', 'Lovely colours and nice composition.', '2006-05-11 11:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405625, 332199, 51538, '<td valign="top">Remarkable building and good title.</td>', 'Remarkable building and good title.', '2006-05-11 11:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405627, 331061, 49326, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very nice. I like it a lot.', '2006-05-11 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405628, 332104, 51538, '<td valign="top">A grand effect nicely captured.</td>', 'A grand effect nicely captured.', '2006-05-11 11:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405629, 331600, 51538, '<td valign="top">Symbolism captured cleanly.  Well done.</td>', 'Symbolism captured cleanly.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 11:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405634, 332015, 51538, '<td valign="top">An interesting place.  I imagine there are distracting visual elements nearby.  It would be nice to have some sort of angle of view on the temple.  Good work.</td>', 'An interesting place.  I imagine there are distracting visual elements nearby.  It would be nice to have some sort of angle of view on the temple.  Good work.', '2006-05-11 11:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405636, 332129, 51538, '<td valign="top">Elegant image which says a lot with simple elements.  The rest of the holy place is implied - but it works well.</td>', 'Elegant image which says a lot with simple elements.  The rest of the holy place is implied - but it works well.', '2006-05-11 11:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405637, 331750, 51538, '<td valign="top">What a grand church and nicely photographed.</td>', 'What a grand church and nicely photographed.', '2006-05-11 11:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405640, 332128, 51538, '<td valign="top">The sunset is lovely and the idea of the silhouette good.  The tree is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The sunset is lovely and the idea of the silhouette good.  The tree is a bit distracting.', '2006-05-11 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405642, 331177, 51538, '<td valign="top">Surely behind you were (are) lots of houses in which the congregation lives - otherwise this is a place in the wilderness.  Nice colours.</td>', 'Surely behind you were (are) lots of houses in which the congregation lives - otherwise this is a place in the wilderness.  Nice colours.', '2006-05-11 11:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405645, 331824, 37965, '<td valign="top">You must believe in the church of baseball!</td>', 'You must believe in the church of baseball!', '2006-05-11 11:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405648, 332478, 51538, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait in a holy place.  Nice tones.  8</td>', 'A lovely portrait in a holy place.  Nice tones.  8', '2006-05-11 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405650, 330464, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The wall is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The wall is a bit distracting.', '2006-05-11 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405653, 331748, 51538, '<td valign="top">The angle obscures the bells too much.  Otherwise the colours are lovely.</td>', 'The angle obscures the bells too much.  Otherwise the colours are lovely.', '2006-05-11 11:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405655, 331032, 51538, '<td valign="top">An evokative image.</td>', 'An evokative image.', '2006-05-11 11:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405659, 332020, 51538, '<td valign="top">Like an image from the past.</td>', 'Like an image from the past.', '2006-05-11 11:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405660, 331856, 51538, '<td valign="top">Certainly interesting.  Not seen anything like this before.</td>', 'Certainly interesting.  Not seen anything like this before.', '2006-05-11 11:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405662, 331493, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well captured.  Do not like the white line border though.</td>', 'Well captured.  Do not like the white line border though.', '2006-05-11 11:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405666, 330631, 51538, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I think it would have been better if her face was in strict profile perhaps - or turned a little more to the camera without losing the sun.</td>', 'Great idea.  I think it would have been better if her face was in strict profile perhaps - or turned a little more to the camera without losing the sun.', '2006-05-11 11:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405668, 332253, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Does the obelisk need a little rotation to the right?</td>', 'Nice sky.  Does the obelisk need a little rotation to the right?', '2006-05-11 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405669, 330169, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  I like the mossy appearance.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  I like the mossy appearance.', '2006-05-11 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405670, 331259, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.</td>', 'Simple but effective.', '2006-05-11 11:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405672, 332110, 51538, '<td valign="top">Indeed, as the title says.</td>', 'Indeed, as the title says.', '2006-05-11 11:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405673, 330517, 51538, '<td valign="top">Tells a story of sorts.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Tells a story of sorts.  Nice idea.', '2006-05-11 11:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405675, 330245, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I am not sure of the angle of view is comfortable though.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I am not sure of the angle of view is comfortable though.', '2006-05-11 11:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405676, 330053, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  An interesting setting.</td>', 'Nicely done.  An interesting setting.', '2006-05-11 11:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405678, 330166, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely site with a lot of potential.  But if only you captured the essence of Stonehenge with some sort of close up.  Perhaps earlier in the morning or later in the day would have helped you with the sky colouring.</td>', 'Lovely site with a lot of potential.  But if only you captured the essence of Stonehenge with some sort of close up.  Perhaps earlier in the morning or later in the day would have helped you with the sky colouring.', '2006-05-11 11:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405679, 331469, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very interesting site.</td>', 'Very interesting site.', '2006-05-11 11:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405682, 330269, 51538, '<td valign="top">The image asks questions.  But I''m not sure what.  Water seems to be associated with ablutions and baptism.  But that''s not happening.  7.</td>', 'The image asks questions.  But I''m not sure what.  Water seems to be associated with ablutions and baptism.  But that''s not happening.  7.', '2006-05-11 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405735, 331618, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of having a large negative space.  It really gives the viewer the sense that the world is being watched over by the subject.  Good job.</td>', 'I like your choice of having a large negative space.  It really gives the viewer the sense that the world is being watched over by the subject.  Good job.', '2006-05-11 12:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405738, 332206, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and good use of wide angle.  Gives the viewer a good sense of the large size of the church. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice perspective and good use of wide angle.  Gives the viewer a good sense of the large size of the church. Nicely done.', '2006-05-11 12:13:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2405741, 331501, 55746, '<td valign="top">I really like the quality of light in this photo.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like the quality of light in this photo.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 12:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405751, 331954, 55746, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have given the church scene some action by having your subject in prayer. Your kneeling subject inside the volumnous church illustrates humility and reverance.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like how you have given the church scene some action by having your subject in prayer. Your kneeling subject inside the volumnous church illustrates humility and reverance.  Good job.', '2006-05-11 12:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405757, 331061, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like your use of depth of field and the rhythm in your photo.</td>', 'I like your use of depth of field and the rhythm in your photo.', '2006-05-11 12:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405762, 331138, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and good color.</td>', 'Nice silhouette and good color.', '2006-05-11 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405778, 331190, 55746, '<td valign="top">This steeple really punches out of your photo.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'This steeple really punches out of your photo.  Very nicely done.', '2006-05-11 12:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405792, 332400, 55746, '<td valign="top">Great texture.  Wonderful subject - the hint of the angel wing behind the flowers is very nice.</td>', 'Great texture.  Wonderful subject - the hint of the angel wing behind the flowers is very nice.', '2006-05-11 12:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405797, 332026, 55746, '<td valign="top">Great subject, nice texture which really gives the sense of antiquity.</td>', 'Great subject, nice texture which really gives the sense of antiquity.', '2006-05-11 12:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405799, 331956, 56579, '<td valign="top">image is underexposed and lacks intrest</td>', 'image is underexposed and lacks intrest', '2006-05-11 12:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405800, 329685, 55746, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting and sense of size. Nicely done.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting and sense of size. Nicely done.', '2006-05-11 12:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405805, 332212, 55746, '<td valign="top">Lovely sense of rhythm and gives the viewer the sense of ascent.</td>', 'Lovely sense of rhythm and gives the viewer the sense of ascent.', '2006-05-11 12:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405809, 332362, 55746, '<td valign="top">Very beatiful - nice lighting and contrast.  The colors are warm and inviting and draw the eye away from the shadows.</td>', 'Very beatiful - nice lighting and contrast.  The colors are warm and inviting and draw the eye away from the shadows.', '2006-05-11 12:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405816, 331520, 55746, '<td valign="top">Good subject - the movement of the subjects gives the viewer the sense of their anticipation. Nice job.</td>', 'Good subject - the movement of the subjects gives the viewer the sense of their anticipation. Nice job.', '2006-05-11 12:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405819, 331514, 56579, '<td valign="top">focus seems soft</td>', 'focus seems soft', '2006-05-11 12:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405828, 331890, 56579, '<td valign="top">the merger with the circle and the line at the bottom are destrating...you should have made the photo wider and cut a little off the bottom.</td>', 'the merger with the circle and the line at the bottom are destrating...you should have made the photo wider and cut a little off the bottom.', '2006-05-11 12:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405832, 330506, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and you did a nice job with the exposure.  In a perfect world I would have liked to see more of it and have the horizontal bar cropped out.</td>', 'Nice subject and you did a nice job with the exposure.  In a perfect world I would have liked to see more of it and have the horizontal bar cropped out.', '2006-05-11 12:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405836, 332001, 55746, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  I love the how the angle hands points in the angle of the ground.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Good subject.  I love the how the angle hands points in the angle of the ground.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-11 12:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405838, 330957, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice use of depth of field.</td>', 'Nice use of depth of field.', '2006-05-11 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405854, 332327, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, people fitting Joey jumping into every challenge. Maybe for a humour challenge, not for this one, sorry.</td>', 'Wow, people fitting Joey jumping into every challenge. Maybe for a humour challenge, not for this one, sorry.', '2006-05-11 12:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405855, 331521, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the composition even if it is tilted a bit</td>', 'Nice, I like the composition even if it is tilted a bit', '2006-05-11 12:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405856, 331190, 43774, '<td valign="top">Could use a bit of contrast or brightening up. I like that the gold is so bright against the grey sky, though, good contrast. Seems to be a lot of grain in the photo.</td>', 'Could use a bit of contrast or brightening up. I like that the gold is so bright against the grey sky, though, good contrast. Seems to be a lot of grain in the photo.', '2006-05-11 12:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405859, 331606, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interetsing, not sure if I like the inclusion of the statues or not. Needs to be rotated right just a bit.</td>', 'Interetsing, not sure if I like the inclusion of the statues or not. Needs to be rotated right just a bit.', '2006-05-11 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405863, 332416, 43774, '<td valign="top">This could be a stunning photo with a little bit more work. It seems fuzzy, not quite in focus. There seems to be a lot of noise in the photo too. Very good composition, though, I like the slightly off center placement of the door.</td>', 'This could be a stunning photo with a little bit more work. It seems fuzzy, not quite in focus. There seems to be a lot of noise in the photo too. Very good composition, though, I like the slightly off center placement of the door.', '2006-05-11 12:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405864, 331600, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, could use a bit more sharpening or contrast, seems a bit flat now.</td>', 'Nice set up, could use a bit more sharpening or contrast, seems a bit flat now.', '2006-05-11 12:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405866, 330063, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good angle but it''s not quite in focus</td>', 'Good angle but it''s not quite in focus', '2006-05-11 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405869, 331588, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the church and the colours but I am not fond of the lamp</td>', 'I like the church and the colours but I am not fond of the lamp', '2006-05-11 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405872, 331032, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit dull (needs brightening up and contrast). House seems tilted to the left.</td>', 'Image is a bit dull (needs brightening up and contrast). House seems tilted to the left.', '2006-05-11 12:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405876, 332449, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this fits the challenge at all. Your title says garden but all we see is a macro of a flower. Photo itself is grainy, fuzzy and the lighting is flat.</td>', 'I don''t think this fits the challenge at all. Your title says garden but all we see is a macro of a flower. Photo itself is grainy, fuzzy and the lighting is flat.', '2006-05-11 12:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405883, 332169, 43774, '<td valign="top">For a humour challenge, maybe, not for this challenge. And if you''re going to call this an unholy place, don''t have "healthy choice" foods in there. :)</td>', 'For a humour challenge, maybe, not for this challenge. And if you''re going to call this an unholy place, don''t have "healthy choice" foods in there. :)', '2006-05-11 12:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405888, 330517, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is this referring to the television show (I''ve never seen it). It''s certainly different and unusual. Not a bad photograph, I might have left out the purse.</td>', 'Is this referring to the television show (I''ve never seen it). It''s certainly different and unusual. Not a bad photograph, I might have left out the purse.', '2006-05-11 12:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405892, 331939, 43774, '<td valign="top">The candle is overexposed, image would be better if it were perfectly centered</td>', 'The candle is overexposed, image would be better if it were perfectly centered', '2006-05-11 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405900, 332411, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, seems a bit fuzzy (sharpening might help). I like the composition except for the bright white area behind the statue</td>', 'Nice, seems a bit fuzzy (sharpening might help). I like the composition except for the bright white area behind the statue', '2006-05-11 13:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405903, 331997, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image doesn''t seem quite in focus. Lots of bland, washed out sky that does not add to the photo.</td>', 'Image doesn''t seem quite in focus. Lots of bland, washed out sky that does not add to the photo.', '2006-05-11 13:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405906, 331166, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not bad, sky could use some contrast (I see a few dirty specks in the sky as well)</td>', 'Not bad, sky could use some contrast (I see a few dirty specks in the sky as well)', '2006-05-11 13:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405911, 332241, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice subject - unique and different than the standard church scene.  In a perfect world I would have liked to have seen the right side of the cross.</td>', 'Nice subject - unique and different than the standard church scene.  In a perfect world I would have liked to have seen the right side of the cross.', '2006-05-11 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405913, 332316, 43774, '<td valign="top">Poor exposure (overexposed sky and dark foreground). I realize you were trying to catch the setting sun but perhaps shooting at a different time of the day would improve the photo.</td>', 'Poor exposure (overexposed sky and dark foreground). I realize you were trying to catch the setting sun but perhaps shooting at a different time of the day would improve the photo.', '2006-05-11 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405915, 330072, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not bad, good composition although the photo seems a little contrasty.</td>', 'Not bad, good composition although the photo seems a little contrasty.', '2006-05-11 13:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405918, 331971, 43774, '<td valign="top">Funny, doesn''t seem quite in focus or as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'Funny, doesn''t seem quite in focus or as sharp as it could be.', '2006-05-11 13:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405921, 332220, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I like the curves of the arch and window. Wish the light from the window weren''t so bright.</td>', 'Nice composition, I like the curves of the arch and window. Wish the light from the window weren''t so bright.', '2006-05-11 13:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405922, 330631, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely DOF, maybe a little too centered</td>', 'Lovely DOF, maybe a little too centered', '2006-05-11 13:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405923, 332092, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette, I''d brighten it up a bit</td>', 'Good silhouette, I''d brighten it up a bit', '2006-05-11 13:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405925, 331825, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and off center placement of the angel.</td>', 'Nice composition and off center placement of the angel.', '2006-05-11 13:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405929, 332454, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a stretch to fit this into the challenge.</td>', 'I think it''s a stretch to fit this into the challenge.', '2006-05-11 13:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405930, 331972, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow</td>', 'I like the shadow', '2006-05-11 13:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405935, 332185, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think this is a stretch to fit into the challenge but others might not think so. Image seems tilted a bit to the left.</td>', 'I think this is a stretch to fit into the challenge but others might not think so. Image seems tilted a bit to the left.', '2006-05-11 13:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405939, 332308, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image is very dark and dull, needs to be brightened up. It''s also tilted slightly to the left.</td>', 'Image is very dark and dull, needs to be brightened up. It''s also tilted slightly to the left.', '2006-05-11 13:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405948, 332121, 43774, '<td valign="top">An amazing building, shame you didn''t make sure your photo was straight (a slight rotation is all it needs). Composition could be improved by cropping out the tall smoke stack on the left and maybe even getting closer to show us some of that amazing architecture. You don''t have to fit the entire building into the photo, sometimes a closer look is better.</td>', 'An amazing building, shame you didn''t make sure your photo was straight (a slight rotation is all it needs). Composition could be improved by cropping out the tall smoke stack on the left and maybe even getting closer to show us some of that amazing architecture. You don''t have to fit the entire building into the photo, sometimes a closer look is better.', '2006-05-11 13:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405950, 330187, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, it''s tilted to the left though. I think cropping out the pews in the foreground would help too.</td>', 'Nice lighting, it''s tilted to the left though. I think cropping out the pews in the foreground would help too.', '2006-05-11 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405951, 329865, 29154, '<td valign="top">Nice capture ... just needs a little tilt.</td>', 'Nice capture ... just needs a little tilt.', '2006-05-11 13:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405952, 331670, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not fond of this at all. Obviously with a night shot you are going to see the movement of people but the one person blurred directly in front of the camera is really distracting.....it ruins the entire photo. Not sure if you used a tripod because the wall itself doesn''t seem to be quite in focus.</td>', 'Not fond of this at all. Obviously with a night shot you are going to see the movement of people but the one person blurred directly in front of the camera is really distracting.....it ruins the entire photo. Not sure if you used a tripod because the wall itself doesn''t seem to be quite in focus.', '2006-05-11 13:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405953, 331607, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not bad, there seems to be a lot of grain in the photo</td>', 'Not bad, there seems to be a lot of grain in the photo', '2006-05-11 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405968, 330387, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love how the use of the wide angle lens and the resulting distortion pulls your eye to the front of the church.  Nice job!</td>', 'I love how the use of the wide angle lens and the resulting distortion pulls your eye to the front of the church.  Nice job!', '2006-05-11 13:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406045, 332478, 50695, '<td valign="top">great portrait, but a stretch for meeting the challenge.</td>', 'great portrait, but a stretch for meeting the challenge.', '2006-05-11 13:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
