(2406249, 332454, 24991, '<td valign="top">I love your gray tones!  This is the way I shoot film, I under expose and under develop so I have a much greater tonal range in the midtones, and don''t blow out the highlights.  I''m not seeing all the zones though, I don''t see a pure black, or a pure white.</td>', 'I love your gray tones!  This is the way I shoot film, I under expose and under develop so I have a much greater tonal range in the midtones, and don''t blow out the highlights.  I''m not seeing all the zones though, I don''t see a pure black, or a pure white.', '2006-05-11 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
