(2406466, 329777, 12733, '<td valign="top">I try to take a liberal view of how a photo fits the theme, but I don''t see a holy place here. It may be that the atmosphere, setting, quiet or another element of the scene makes this spot holy for you, but it doesn''t come through for me in the picture.</td>', 'I try to take a liberal view of how a photo fits the theme, but I don''t see a holy place here. It may be that the atmosphere, setting, quiet or another element of the scene makes this spot holy for you, but it doesn''t come through for me in the picture.', '2006-05-11 16:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406476, 331890, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the simplicity of a mostly monochrome scene. I think there''s a lost opportunity here - that window could add a contrasting glow if the light were right.</td>', 'I like the composition and the simplicity of a mostly monochrome scene. I think there''s a lost opportunity here - that window could add a contrasting glow if the light were right.', '2006-05-11 16:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
