(2406482, 331469, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the glow on the minaret and the brightness on the sand. The contrast with the dark walls is very strong - possibly could have been pulled down a little in photoshop. It''s a very striking picture, though.</td>', 'I really like the glow on the minaret and the brightness on the sand. The contrast with the dark walls is very strong - possibly could have been pulled down a little in photoshop. It''s a very striking picture, though.', '2006-05-11 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406490, 332400, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious - maybe too mysterious. There''s a lot of interpretation possible in that background - it makes for an interesting image, if somewhat confusing if you don''t take a lot of time over it.</td>', 'Very mysterious - maybe too mysterious. There''s a lot of interpretation possible in that background - it makes for an interesting image, if somewhat confusing if you don''t take a lot of time over it.', '2006-05-11 16:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406492, 331660, 12733, '<td valign="top">If Max Escher took photographs, this might be one. The angle, the arched windows, the angry sky - it all comes together for a great image.</td>', 'If Max Escher took photographs, this might be one. The angle, the arched windows, the angry sky - it all comes together for a great image.', '2006-05-11 16:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406497, 330584, 12733, '<td valign="top">St. John''s is a very pretty church, and this is a nice rendering. Just a bit pedestrian for a challenge; it would be great on the cover of the church bulletin.</td>', 'St. John''s is a very pretty church, and this is a nice rendering. Just a bit pedestrian for a challenge; it would be great on the cover of the church bulletin.', '2006-05-11 16:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406500, 332026, 12733, '<td valign="top">The dark, brooding feel does give a sense of spirituality and mystery - but I''d like to get a better view of the undoubtedly interesting old stone work. Maybe a touch lighter, or a bit less contrast?</td>', 'The dark, brooding feel does give a sense of spirituality and mystery - but I''d like to get a better view of the undoubtedly interesting old stone work. Maybe a touch lighter, or a bit less contrast?', '2006-05-11 16:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406505, 331965, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and a nice view of the rest of the town. I especially like the row of cottages (is that what those white buildings are?).</td>', 'Nice lighting, and a nice view of the rest of the town. I especially like the row of cottages (is that what those white buildings are?).', '2006-05-11 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406512, 332360, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is she real or a statue? I''ve never seen a statue in a pose like that one, but I''ve never seen a real woman who looks so much like stone. I especially like the contrast between the monochrome stone and the colorful flowers.</td>', 'Is she real or a statue? I''ve never seen a statue in a pose like that one, but I''ve never seen a real woman who looks so much like stone. I especially like the contrast between the monochrome stone and the colorful flowers.', '2006-05-11 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406515, 330346, 12733, '<td valign="top">That golden lighting makes the shot. Correcting the white balance would have blown it. Looks like you used a starburst filter?</td>', 'That golden lighting makes the shot. Correcting the white balance would have blown it. Looks like you used a starburst filter?', '2006-05-11 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406519, 332363, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way this angle emphasizes the tall cupola and spire. You got a great sky, and there''s enough light on most parts of the church to bring out the texture of the stone.</td>', 'I like the way this angle emphasizes the tall cupola and spire. You got a great sky, and there''s enough light on most parts of the church to bring out the texture of the stone.', '2006-05-11 16:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406522, 332204, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the expressions on the women''s faces. It must be a fascinating homily, or they posed very well. Nice capture of the church background too.</td>', 'Great capture of the expressions on the women''s faces. It must be a fascinating homily, or they posed very well. Nice capture of the church background too.', '2006-05-11 16:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406530, 332241, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, beautiful subject. I find the light spillover distracting - after appreciating the excellent texture of wood and metal I asked myself, couldn''t they have shut the door?</td>', 'Nice concept, beautiful subject. I find the light spillover distracting - after appreciating the excellent texture of wood and metal I asked myself, couldn''t they have shut the door?', '2006-05-11 16:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406535, 329954, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and cloud textures. I don''t know about holy, but it sure is awesome. I''d like to see this printed as a 16X20 or larger poster!</td>', 'Brilliant colors and cloud textures. I don''t know about holy, but it sure is awesome. I''d like to see this printed as a 16X20 or larger poster!', '2006-05-11 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
