(2407092, 332342, 56254, '<td valign="top">I like the cloud "halo" around the statue, nice composition ... I just wish the arbor vitae trees weren''t growing out of his shoulders ...</td>', 'I like the cloud "halo" around the statue, nice composition ... I just wish the arbor vitae trees weren''t growing out of his shoulders ...', '2006-05-11 19:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
