(2407102, 332229, 56254, '<td valign="top">The red door really makes this photo pop!  I like the way the tree line leads you right to the door ... very nice!</td>', 'The red door really makes this photo pop!  I like the way the tree line leads you right to the door ... very nice!', '2006-05-11 19:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407103, 331186, 56254, '<td valign="top">you''ve captured amazing detail ... very well done ...</td>', 'you''ve captured amazing detail ... very well done ...', '2006-05-11 19:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407106, 332199, 56254, '<td valign="top">I feel like the sky might be a bit overprocessed compared to the reflection in the church ...</td>', 'I feel like the sky might be a bit overprocessed compared to the reflection in the church ...', '2006-05-11 19:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407107, 331389, 56254, '<td valign="top">I love old cemetary''s and headstones, nice photo</td>', 'I love old cemetary''s and headstones, nice photo', '2006-05-11 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407110, 332197, 56254, '<td valign="top">great old church, I wish I could see more detail of the foreground though ...</td>', 'great old church, I wish I could see more detail of the foreground though ...', '2006-05-11 19:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407166, 332204, 14951, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! Great capture of the moment :) I hope it places well!</td>', 'I love this photo! Great capture of the moment :) I hope it places well!', '2006-05-11 20:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407211, 332308, 55746, '<td valign="top">You chose a good subject and did a nice job with the perspective.   You lost a lot of detail in the window and the color is quite flat.  Next time you might try capturing a subject like this during the day.</td>', 'You chose a good subject and did a nice job with the perspective.   You lost a lot of detail in the window and the color is quite flat.  Next time you might try capturing a subject like this during the day.', '2006-05-11 20:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407219, 332478, 55746, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait.  It feels very candid and joyful. I might have liked a touch more contrast but your choice lends itself well to the softness of her dress and hair.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait.  It feels very candid and joyful. I might have liked a touch more contrast but your choice lends itself well to the softness of her dress and hair.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-11 20:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407222, 332379, 55746, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject.  Would love to know more about it.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very interesting subject.  Would love to know more about it.  Nice job.', '2006-05-11 20:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407228, 332446, 55746, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love your choice of colors - it makes it very other worldly.  Your lighting and contrast are superb.</td>', 'Great shot!  I love your choice of colors - it makes it very other worldly.  Your lighting and contrast are superb.', '2006-05-11 20:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407234, 332342, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of placement of your son.  Your perspective looks like you are shooting from below him which really gives the statue behind your son great "protective" presence.</td>', 'Nice choice of placement of your son.  Your perspective looks like you are shooting from below him which really gives the statue behind your son great "protective" presence.', '2006-05-11 20:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407246, 332062, 55746, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject and I love how you have framed it with the silhouette.  Good job!  Your highlights might be a touch overexposed but you still have good colors so it is a tough call.  Love the photo.</td>', 'Wonderful subject and I love how you have framed it with the silhouette.  Good job!  Your highlights might be a touch overexposed but you still have good colors so it is a tough call.  Love the photo.', '2006-05-11 20:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407254, 331660, 55746, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject! The angles provide a lot of rhythm and I love the mood of the clouds.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very interesting subject! The angles provide a lot of rhythm and I love the mood of the clouds.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-11 20:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407260, 332228, 55746, '<td valign="top">Great texture and nice choice of black and white.  Well done.</td>', 'Great texture and nice choice of black and white.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 20:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407272, 329864, 55746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love your choice of positioning yourself so that you can capture more of the windows rather than the typical straight down the center aisle.  Lovely color saturation and texture.  The repetition of the columns draw me in and keep me with the photo for a long time.  Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love your choice of positioning yourself so that you can capture more of the windows rather than the typical straight down the center aisle.  Lovely color saturation and texture.  The repetition of the columns draw me in and keep me with the photo for a long time.  Nice job!', '2006-05-11 20:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407284, 332229, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love the complementing red door and green leaves.  Your positioning allows the trees to pull me to the door.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I love the complementing red door and green leaves.  Your positioning allows the trees to pull me to the door.  Nicely done!', '2006-05-11 20:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407289, 332073, 55746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft lighting.  She is beautiful.  Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful soft lighting.  She is beautiful.  Good job!', '2006-05-11 20:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407295, 331404, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing detail in what appears to be a difficult lighting situation.  I love the colors.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice job capturing detail in what appears to be a difficult lighting situation.  I love the colors.  Good job!', '2006-05-11 20:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407302, 332438, 55746, '<td valign="top">Stunning architechtural subject.  You did a nice job with the exposure.  I might like to see a tighter crop on this subject.</td>', 'Stunning architechtural subject.  You did a nice job with the exposure.  I might like to see a tighter crop on this subject.', '2006-05-11 20:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407317, 331677, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like that you framed the church with the trees and bell tower.  This looked to be a difficult lighting situation and it resulted in your photo being overexposed which has caused you to loose detail.</td>', 'I like that you framed the church with the trees and bell tower.  This looked to be a difficult lighting situation and it resulted in your photo being overexposed which has caused you to loose detail.', '2006-05-11 21:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407333, 332028, 55746, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and good texture.  I might like to see the wall darkened up a bit as it seems a bit overexposed and it might be neat to do a tight crop on the windows.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting subject and good texture.  I might like to see the wall darkened up a bit as it seems a bit overexposed and it might be neat to do a tight crop on the windows.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-11 21:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407348, 332286, 55746, '<td valign="top">Creative idea!  I like the angles of his body and the club and the horizons - gives the photo lots of rhythm and keeps me with the photo longer.  Good job.</td>', 'Creative idea!  I like the angles of his body and the club and the horizons - gives the photo lots of rhythm and keeps me with the photo longer.  Good job.', '2006-05-11 21:05:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2407361, 329865, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! Good lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice idea! Good lighting.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 21:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407373, 332185, 54369, '<td valign="top">love the shot!<br/> <br/>All hai lto the Soccer Gods!</td>', 'love the shot! All hai lto the Soccer Gods!', '2006-05-11 21:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407377, 331697, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love this shot but would have preferred a tighter crop on the alter which would have kept me with the subject.  The pole to the right and the items on the left pull me away from where the attention should be.  I like your color saturation and exposure.</td>', 'I love this shot but would have preferred a tighter crop on the alter which would have kept me with the subject.  The pole to the right and the items on the left pull me away from where the attention should be.  I like your color saturation and exposure.', '2006-05-11 21:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407393, 331607, 55746, '<td valign="top">Very moody.  I love the contrast.  Well done!</td>', 'Very moody.  I love the contrast.  Well done!', '2006-05-11 21:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407408, 331857, 55746, '<td valign="top">Wow! Stunning color and texture.  This has great movement towards the alter due to the capture of the repetition of the windows.  I do believe that the photo is so dense that the girl is a little lost.</td>', 'Wow! Stunning color and texture.  This has great movement towards the alter due to the capture of the repetition of the windows.  I do believe that the photo is so dense that the girl is a little lost.', '2006-05-11 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407424, 332202, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love this - it is very timeless and could have been taken 100 years ago.  Nice contrast.  Good job!</td>', 'I love this - it is very timeless and could have been taken 100 years ago.  Nice contrast.  Good job!', '2006-05-11 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407435, 332470, 55746, '<td valign="top">Interesting twist on the challenge.  I feel like this is very old and I like the textures.</td>', 'Interesting twist on the challenge.  I feel like this is very old and I like the textures.', '2006-05-11 21:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407446, 331497, 55746, '<td valign="top">Amazing use of depth of field without loosing the nose and lips.  Beautiful photo - I am envious of those eyelashes!</td>', 'Amazing use of depth of field without loosing the nose and lips.  Beautiful photo - I am envious of those eyelashes!', '2006-05-11 21:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407458, 331852, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I believe that this could have benefited from a tighter crop which would remove the white lines in the foreground.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I believe that this could have benefited from a tighter crop which would remove the white lines in the foreground.', '2006-05-11 21:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407462, 332308, 36382, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast and brightness would have helped this image.</td>', 'A bit more contrast and brightness would have helped this image.', '2006-05-11 21:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407468, 332289, 36382, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks distorted.</td>', 'Kinda looks distorted.', '2006-05-11 21:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407470, 331178, 55746, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo!  I love the honesty in this.  The contrast is super.  The tight crop makes me feel like I am there.  Good job.</td>', 'Wonderful photo!  I love the honesty in this.  The contrast is super.  The tight crop makes me feel like I am there.  Good job.', '2006-05-11 21:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407474, 332199, 55746, '<td valign="top">Amazing building and I love how you captured the reflections.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Amazing building and I love how you captured the reflections.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-11 21:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407480, 332224, 55746, '<td valign="top">Great sentiment.  I like the selective saturation - it really lends itself to your title.  Well done.</td>', 'Great sentiment.  I like the selective saturation - it really lends itself to your title.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 21:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407487, 332020, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and grain.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the texture and grain.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 21:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407495, 331177, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  The colors are wonderful!  Very inviting.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  The colors are wonderful!  Very inviting.  Well done.', '2006-05-11 21:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2407503, 331038, 55746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  I love your use of the tight crop so the god is framed by the flowers.  Your contrast is spot on.  Good show!</td>', 'Beautiful color.  I love your use of the tight crop so the god is framed by the flowers.  Your contrast is spot on.  Good show!', '2006-05-11 21:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
