(2407572, 332454, 49773, '<td valign="top">Lacks contrast. Plus, it''s not obvious without a title that this is a toilet or whatever you refer to.</td>', 'Lacks contrast. Plus, it''s not obvious without a title that this is a toilet or whatever you refer to.', '2006-05-11 22:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
