(2407991, 330440, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors (Blue and Yellow) and good composition.  That thing in the bottom, just right of center is the only distracting thing.</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors (Blue and Yellow) and good composition.  That thing in the bottom, just right of center is the only distracting thing.', '2006-05-12 00:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
