(2407998, 332426, 40580, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked to have seen more detail in the garden since that''s the title.</td>', 'I would''ve liked to have seen more detail in the garden since that''s the title.', '2006-05-12 00:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408002, 332153, 40580, '<td valign="top">Good, except it''s leaning to the right.</td>', 'Good, except it''s leaning to the right.', '2006-05-12 00:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408005, 330417, 33683, '<td valign="top">This must be the only one i really liked in this challenge, unlike the usual shot this gives an oh so eerie feel and the church is like a beacon in a wasteland as well as the reflecting pool mirrors hope in such a desolate setting. Great shot.</td>', 'This must be the only one i really liked in this challenge, unlike the usual shot this gives an oh so eerie feel and the church is like a beacon in a wasteland as well as the reflecting pool mirrors hope in such a desolate setting. Great shot.', '2006-05-12 00:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408006, 331890, 40580, '<td valign="top">Would score higher if it was squared.</td>', 'Would score higher if it was squared.', '2006-05-12 00:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408013, 332197, 54212, '<td valign="top">To soft loks out of focus</td>', 'To soft loks out of focus', '2006-05-12 00:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408014, 332157, 40580, '<td valign="top">Little picture.  There''s a purple cast to the church too.  Did you take this with a phone camera?</td>', 'Little picture.  There''s a purple cast to the church too.  Did you take this with a phone camera?', '2006-05-12 00:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408019, 332454, 40580, '<td valign="top">I like the wit.  Good shot too.  Nice compe</td>', 'I like the wit.  Good shot too.  Nice compe', '2006-05-12 00:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408024, 332308, 40580, '<td valign="top">Underexposed.  Needs more contrast.  Nice composition tho.</td>', 'Underexposed.  Needs more contrast.  Nice composition tho.', '2006-05-12 00:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408025, 332358, 54212, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few in the group that tells a good story: the title is not needed.</td>', 'This is one of the few in the group that tells a good story: the title is not needed.', '2006-05-12 00:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408038, 332314, 54212, '<td valign="top">Needs some one here praying; it would have told a much better story</td>', 'Needs some one here praying; it would have told a much better story', '2006-05-12 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408041, 331956, 40580, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Crappy lighting.  Try better next time.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Crappy lighting.  Try better next time.', '2006-05-12 00:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408049, 332319, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very cool point of view for this shot. I really like how you''ve played on the symmetry here. Nice job.</td>', 'A very cool point of view for this shot. I really like how you''ve played on the symmetry here. Nice job.', '2006-05-12 00:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408053, 330417, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool use of reflection here. Great concept. Nice shot.</td>', 'Very cool use of reflection here. Great concept. Nice shot.', '2006-05-12 00:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408090, 331178, 50695, '<td valign="top">the wailing wall? if so, it''s the best picture of the wailing wall I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'the wailing wall? if so, it''s the best picture of the wailing wall I''ve ever seen.', '2006-05-12 00:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408114, 332474, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a way cool shot. Great use of patterns and repetition. Nice lines. Well done!</td>', 'This is a way cool shot. Great use of patterns and repetition. Nice lines. Well done!', '2006-05-12 00:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408116, 331259, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I like it''s simplicity and how it doesn''t speak to just one religion/spiritual belief.</td>', 'I really like this. I like it''s simplicity and how it doesn''t speak to just one religion/spiritual belief.', '2006-05-12 00:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408125, 331415, 41337, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail. The crop works. Maybe it would have been better if you cropped out the bright spot but it doesn''t bother me too much.</td>', 'Amazing detail. The crop works. Maybe it would have been better if you cropped out the bright spot but it doesn''t bother me too much.', '2006-05-12 00:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408143, 330631, 19831, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a pretty good shot. I wondered if some people might attempt this type of intrepretation of the challenge, and how would they fare. I think you''ve managed to convey the concept nicely in this case. I can get your feeling :-) I think you''ve even managed to make the centered comp work well. Great use of dof. It''s obvious you put some thought and care into finding the proper setting, it just works well. Although, I''ll venture to guess that perhaps why this works well is that this really is a special place for you. The little sapling behind her is a nice touch for some reason. Interesting, you''ve broken a couple rules. The centered comp, the tree line going across center of frame, but...it just really works well. The shot is nice. I love it when people break rules and make it ''work''. :-) Really nice job, I like this shot. Well done. Good luck, and I hope voters can see the magic in this image. :-)</td>', 'I find this to be a pretty good shot. I wondered if some people might attempt this type of intrepretation of the challenge, and how would they fare. I think you''ve managed to convey the concept nicely in this case. I can get your feeling :-) I think you''ve even managed to make the centered comp work well. Great use of dof. It''s obvious you put some thought and care into finding the proper setting, it just works well. Although, I''ll venture to guess that perhaps why this works well is that this really is a special place for you. The little sapling behind her is a nice touch for some reason. Interesting, you''ve broken a couple rules. The centered comp, the tree line going across center of frame, but...it just really works well. The shot is nice. I love it when people break rules and make it ''work''. :-) Really nice job, I like this shot. Well done. Good luck, and I hope voters can see the magic in this image. :-)', '2006-05-12 00:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408159, 331259, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the very clean, minimalist composition. It is very strong in it''s simplicity.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the very clean, minimalist composition. It is very strong in it''s simplicity.', '2006-05-12 00:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408185, 331178, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very refreshing approach to the challenge. I like it! Nice job on the processing.</td>', 'Very refreshing approach to the challenge. I like it! Nice job on the processing.', '2006-05-12 01:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408195, 332208, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the technicals. However I''m having trouble connecting with this to be honest. I find myself more interested in the things that are further away in this photo including the inside, which we can''t see at all. I think this would have worked better if there was someone in the shot who I can identify with.</td>', 'I like the technicals. However I''m having trouble connecting with this to be honest. I find myself more interested in the things that are further away in this photo including the inside, which we can''t see at all. I think this would have worked better if there was someone in the shot who I can identify with.', '2006-05-12 01:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408204, 330440, 41521, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasts shown here - harshness of stone with the softness of clouds, the blue against the yellow.</td>', 'I love the contrasts shown here - harshness of stone with the softness of clouds, the blue against the yellow.', '2006-05-12 01:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408205, 329510, 41521, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This has a way over-processed feel to it.  I think the image would have been lovely, had it not been quite so "tweaked".</td>', 'Wow.  This has a way over-processed feel to it.  I think the image would have been lovely, had it not been quite so "tweaked".', '2006-05-12 01:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408275, 332299, 48479, '<td valign="top">A little slanty but nice framing</td>', 'A little slanty but nice framing', '2006-05-12 01:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408278, 332212, 48479, '<td valign="top">Cool garden</td>', 'Cool garden', '2006-05-12 01:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408282, 332220, 48479, '<td valign="top">Great subject</td>', 'Great subject', '2006-05-12 01:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408294, 332319, 54455, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a Holy Places picture with believers in it.  A building is just a building.</td>', 'Nice to see a Holy Places picture with believers in it.  A building is just a building.', '2006-05-12 01:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408453, 332110, 30490, '<td valign="top">Ahh Hallstatt Austria - definately Peaceful, one of my favorite places in the world! This was one of the places I thought of when this challenge was announced.  It is nice that someone was there and could enter a photo from this this place.  Did you see the Catholic church?  Very pretty this time of year with the flowers growing on the graves.<br/> <br/>I like the perspective of your photo which I suspect was taken from the park at the end of town.  A nice job overall.</td>', 'Ahh Hallstatt Austria - definately Peaceful, one of my favorite places in the world! This was one of the places I thought of when this challenge was announced.  It is nice that someone was there and could enter a photo from this this place.  Did you see the Catholic church?  Very pretty this time of year with the flowers growing on the graves. I like the perspective of your photo which I suspect was taken from the park at the end of town.  A nice job overall.', '2006-05-12 02:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408494, 332472, 57104, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2006-05-12 03:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408531, 332479, 57229, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice literary set up to picture the symbols of belief in the catechism, on which belief its holiness is dependent. I think the problem is that anything that departs from the ''obvious'' interpretation of the challenge has to stand out as exceptional. This isn''t better than good. Come to think of it, I''ll vote you an extra point for the well composed simplicity.</td>', 'It''s a nice literary set up to picture the symbols of belief in the catechism, on which belief its holiness is dependent. I think the problem is that anything that departs from the ''obvious'' interpretation of the challenge has to stand out as exceptional. This isn''t better than good. Come to think of it, I''ll vote you an extra point for the well composed simplicity.', '2006-05-12 03:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408535, 332299, 57229, '<td valign="top">My rule of thumb for arcitectural shots like this, where perspective throws the lines out of parallel, is to make the leading edge vertical. This looks skew-wiff. Straightforward interpretation nicely composed together with the garden elements. Looks on the bright side of holiness :)</td>', 'My rule of thumb for arcitectural shots like this, where perspective throws the lines out of parallel, is to make the leading edge vertical. This looks skew-wiff. Straightforward interpretation nicely composed together with the garden elements. Looks on the bright side of holiness :)', '2006-05-12 03:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408537, 332123, 57229, '<td valign="top">You''d have to say it was something of a cliché, but it''s painstakingly well put together, by the architect, the stonemasons and the photogapher. Nice shot.</td>', 'You''d have to say it was something of a cliché, but it''s painstakingly well put together, by the architect, the stonemasons and the photogapher. Nice shot.', '2006-05-12 03:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408542, 332249, 57229, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely shot, with the saturated bright colours and the striking lines of the cladding on the church. I feel that the boldness of colour detracts from the idea of ''holiness'' though - belongs with children''s toys rather than timeless veneration.</td>', 'It''s a lovely shot, with the saturated bright colours and the striking lines of the cladding on the church. I feel that the boldness of colour detracts from the idea of ''holiness'' though - belongs with children''s toys rather than timeless veneration.', '2006-05-12 03:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408544, 330343, 57229, '<td valign="top">Pleasant tones, but lacking a focal point (figuratively speaking). Needs to straighten up and fly right.</td>', 'Pleasant tones, but lacking a focal point (figuratively speaking). Needs to straighten up and fly right.', '2006-05-12 03:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408546, 332472, 57229, '<td valign="top">There''s some high contrast here that doesn''t reflect the title. As a matter of fact, I feel that the bright lights are detracting from the holiness as well. You''d have been better off just clipping out the frieze from the centre.</td>', 'There''s some high contrast here that doesn''t reflect the title. As a matter of fact, I feel that the bright lights are detracting from the holiness as well. You''d have been better off just clipping out the frieze from the centre.', '2006-05-12 03:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408548, 331943, 57229, '<td valign="top">I think this is looking for connotations of Karma Bum road philosophy. The on-its-own Spartan profile might have benefitted from more sky and less foreground. It comes over as ''almost but not quite'' to me. I like its attitude :)</td>', 'I think this is looking for connotations of Karma Bum road philosophy. The on-its-own Spartan profile might have benefitted from more sky and less foreground. It comes over as ''almost but not quite'' to me. I like its attitude :)', '2006-05-12 04:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408555, 331711, 57229, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shapes and textures. Could just as easily be a library or hotel as a mission (except for the title, of course), but it has peace.</td>', 'Beautiful shapes and textures. Could just as easily be a library or hotel as a mission (except for the title, of course), but it has peace.', '2006-05-12 04:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408560, 331032, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nicely put together, but the praying person in the foreground comes over as idiot-obvious to me, sorry.</td>', 'Nicely put together, but the praying person in the foreground comes over as idiot-obvious to me, sorry.', '2006-05-12 04:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408571, 331376, 57229, '<td valign="top">I bet there''s a big wide aperture involved in this. I''m not the world''s greatest fan of sharpness for sharpness'' sake, but what isn''t dark here is fuzzy. The nearest wing is in focus, I note. I think it was a very difficult shot to pull off, so kudos for this much :)</td>', 'I bet there''s a big wide aperture involved in this. I''m not the world''s greatest fan of sharpness for sharpness'' sake, but what isn''t dark here is fuzzy. The nearest wing is in focus, I note. I think it was a very difficult shot to pull off, so kudos for this much :)', '2006-05-12 04:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408577, 332028, 57229, '<td valign="top">I love the effective understatement of the gothically arched windows. If it were not for them, you could have substituted ''cottage'' for ''church'' in the title.</td>', 'I love the effective understatement of the gothically arched windows. If it were not for them, you could have substituted ''cottage'' for ''church'' in the title.', '2006-05-12 04:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408582, 329929, 57229, '<td valign="top">''Suffer the little children'' - nicely taken.</td>', '''Suffer the little children'' - nicely taken.', '2006-05-12 04:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408584, 332225, 57229, '<td valign="top">The kiss of the sun for pardon<br/>the song of the bird for mirth...</td>', 'The kiss of the sun for pardonthe song of the bird for mirth...', '2006-05-12 04:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408587, 331697, 57229, '<td valign="top">Dammit I like this shot. I''m sure it fails all over the place, but thanks for putting it up, anyway.</td>', 'Dammit I like this shot. I''m sure it fails all over the place, but thanks for putting it up, anyway.', '2006-05-12 04:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408588, 332199, 57229, '<td valign="top">Neat architecture.</td>', 'Neat architecture.', '2006-05-12 04:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408725, 331697, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2006-05-12 05:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408726, 332208, 52439, '<td valign="top">Really interesting shot.</td>', 'Really interesting shot.', '2006-05-12 05:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408728, 332460, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow. Shame the colours aren''t abit more vibrant but it still works well.</td>', 'Wow. Shame the colours aren''t abit more vibrant but it still works well.', '2006-05-12 05:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408732, 329954, 52439, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, good idea for the challenge aswell.</td>', 'Fantastic, good idea for the challenge aswell.', '2006-05-12 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408734, 332478, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great impact in this shot, good choice on the colour aswell.</td>', 'Great impact in this shot, good choice on the colour aswell.', '2006-05-12 05:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408736, 331704, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great sky.</td>', 'Great sky.', '2006-05-12 05:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408740, 330417, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2006-05-12 05:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408785, 331956, 24486, '<td valign="top">LOL. I hope your not getting bagged. This really made me laugh.</td>', 'LOL. I hope your not getting bagged. This really made me laugh.', '2006-05-12 06:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408789, 332483, 24486, '<td valign="top">Refreshingly different in this challenge. I like it.</td>', 'Refreshingly different in this challenge. I like it.', '2006-05-12 06:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408790, 332026, 57000, '<td valign="top">..and it´s also a place of history , good shot ;-)</td>', '..and it´s also a place of history , good shot ;-)', '2006-05-12 06:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408838, 332253, 56405, '<td valign="top">I''d like it better if the obalisk was straight.</td>', 'I''d like it better if the obalisk was straight.', '2006-05-12 07:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408853, 331770, 46885, '<td valign="top">You could probably lift the top of the shot via masks, if that was allowed by rules, but in these rules ND filter is recommended.</td>', 'You could probably lift the top of the shot via masks, if that was allowed by rules, but in these rules ND filter is recommended.', '2006-05-12 07:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408858, 332224, 46885, '<td valign="top">I thought for a moment this was a take on Guantanamo base, but then realised Sikhs aren''t classified as suspects :) Good setting.</td>', 'I thought for a moment this was a take on Guantanamo base, but then realised Sikhs aren''t classified as suspects :) Good setting.', '2006-05-12 08:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408874, 331607, 57229, '<td valign="top">Interesting . . . sort of more creepy/striking than holy. Dead space top right bottom left. Nice idea.</td>', 'Interesting . . . sort of more creepy/striking than holy. Dead space top right bottom left. Nice idea.', '2006-05-12 08:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408876, 329567, 57229, '<td valign="top">Quite a striking picture of church architecture, albeit a bit chaotic, but doesn''t say much about holiness IMHO</td>', 'Quite a striking picture of church architecture, albeit a bit chaotic, but doesn''t say much about holiness IMHO', '2006-05-12 08:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408877, 331560, 57229, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2006-05-12 08:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408879, 331704, 57229, '<td valign="top">Indeed. Very nice. Very sharp. Very static.</td>', 'Indeed. Very nice. Very sharp. Very static.', '2006-05-12 08:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408881, 332286, 57229, '<td valign="top">It all looks desperately serious to me DMC</td>', 'It all looks desperately serious to me DMC', '2006-05-12 08:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408882, 332470, 57229, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if I had a sense of humour? Should feel at home where I''d send it...</td>', 'Perhaps if I had a sense of humour? Should feel at home where I''d send it...', '2006-05-12 08:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408883, 332287, 57229, '<td valign="top">A self effacing metaphor. Pleasant pastoral picture.</td>', 'A self effacing metaphor. Pleasant pastoral picture.', '2006-05-12 08:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408885, 330387, 57229, '<td valign="top">I think ''diocese'' refers to the domain of the see, rather than this cathedral which I presume is the seat of it. I could well be wrong.<br/>Nice interior pic. bit blown out to the right and fish-eyed etc., but luverly stuff...</td>', 'I think ''diocese'' refers to the domain of the see, rather than this cathedral which I presume is the seat of it. I could well be wrong.Nice interior pic. bit blown out to the right and fish-eyed etc., but luverly stuff...', '2006-05-12 08:39:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2408886, 332324, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love the blue tome arches, great composition in this image as well.....</td>', 'I love the blue tome arches, great composition in this image as well.....', '2006-05-12 08:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408888, 332046, 57229, '<td valign="top">I''ve a feeling that either the light should be more evenly distributed over the sculptures, or more shadow areas of the niche should be included to justify (demonstrate? show?) the nature of the lighting. Needs a wee bit of rotation.</td>', 'I''ve a feeling that either the light should be more evenly distributed over the sculptures, or more shadow areas of the niche should be included to justify (demonstrate? show?) the nature of the lighting. Needs a wee bit of rotation.', '2006-05-12 08:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408891, 331770, 57229, '<td valign="top">Comes over as more like an exercise in sharpness, even exposure and depth of field (in which it succeeds) than as a depiction of holiness in a place. I guess I''m fussy like that.</td>', 'Comes over as more like an exercise in sharpness, even exposure and depth of field (in which it succeeds) than as a depiction of holiness in a place. I guess I''m fussy like that.', '2006-05-12 08:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408895, 331588, 57229, '<td valign="top">Over-edited with the colours - it looks false and flat. Shame, as the idea and composition deserve better IMHO.</td>', 'Over-edited with the colours - it looks false and flat. Shame, as the idea and composition deserve better IMHO.', '2006-05-12 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408896, 332159, 48228, '<td valign="top">Quite magical, in a many ways.....</td>', 'Quite magical, in a many ways.....', '2006-05-12 08:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408898, 332298, 57229, '<td valign="top">You could have just written the title somewhere and left the picture.</td>', 'You could have just written the title somewhere and left the picture.', '2006-05-12 08:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408900, 331422, 57229, '<td valign="top">Probably need about a third cropping off the right and the same off the bottom. Nice idea otherwise.</td>', 'Probably need about a third cropping off the right and the same off the bottom. Nice idea otherwise.', '2006-05-12 08:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408903, 332400, 39993, '<td valign="top">Like everything in this image.  <br/>The lack of colour the one white focused blossom and the hint of a wing.</td>', 'Like everything in this image.  The lack of colour the one white focused blossom and the hint of a wing.', '2006-05-12 08:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408905, 330346, 57229, '<td valign="top">Would be better without the streetlights, but what can you do? You really don''t need to say ''historic'' in the title - tautological overkill. It''s a magnificent looking place and the texture in this picture gives it poise and such. Holiness is apparent.</td>', 'Would be better without the streetlights, but what can you do? You really don''t need to say ''historic'' in the title - tautological overkill. It''s a magnificent looking place and the texture in this picture gives it poise and such. Holiness is apparent.', '2006-05-12 08:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408906, 331520, 57229, '<td valign="top">Damn my attitude. I can remember my confirmation and approximately how holy I was at the time... Detracts from this, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Damn my attitude. I can remember my confirmation and approximately how holy I was at the time... Detracts from this, I''m afraid.', '2006-05-12 08:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408907, 332362, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, too much of the gloss and rich colour for me.</td>', 'Nice shot, too much of the gloss and rich colour for me.', '2006-05-12 08:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408908, 332327, 48228, '<td valign="top">Sorry, dosen''t suit the challenge at all.....</td>', 'Sorry, dosen''t suit the challenge at all.....', '2006-05-12 08:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408910, 332275, 57229, '<td valign="top">Why does everything have to photo-realistically sharp and gaudy? The choice of place / subject is excellent. I would that it were quieter.</td>', 'Why does everything have to photo-realistically sharp and gaudy? The choice of place / subject is excellent. I would that it were quieter.', '2006-05-12 08:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408911, 332204, 57104, '<td valign="top">Nice photography, particularly like the way the nuns are leaning in to hear what is being said. This photo tells a story, has interest, has interesting lighting and is in focus and clear. This has everything they taught to go for in phototography class. Nice work IMHO.</td>', 'Nice photography, particularly like the way the nuns are leaning in to hear what is being said. This photo tells a story, has interest, has interesting lighting and is in focus and clear. This has everything they taught to go for in phototography class. Nice work IMHO.', '2006-05-12 08:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408912, 331923, 48228, '<td valign="top">Quite magical.....quite beautiful..... I love it.....</td>', 'Quite magical.....quite beautiful..... I love it.....', '2006-05-12 08:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
