(2411145, 331972, 42705, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Its very simple and direct.  One thing I would change though is I would make the cross at a straighter andgle and the shadow at a more important and impactive angle like the hour of death or something.</td>', 'I like it.  Its very simple and direct.  One thing I would change though is I would make the cross at a straighter andgle and the shadow at a more important and impactive angle like the hour of death or something.', '2006-05-13 00:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
