(2411463, 331422, 43115, '<td valign="top">The yellow and blue are very strong compliments.  Strong tie to the challenge.  And I''m a sucker for a good daytime moon shot. :)  Great job!</td>', 'The yellow and blue are very strong compliments.  Strong tie to the challenge.  And I''m a sucker for a good daytime moon shot. :)  Great job!', '2006-05-13 03:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
