(2411468, 331404, 43115, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but there''s something a little fake about it... the glowing cross on the top of the building is the biggest sign that there''s something wrong here.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but there''s something a little fake about it... the glowing cross on the top of the building is the biggest sign that there''s something wrong here.', '2006-05-13 03:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
