(2415786, 331501, 29442, '<td valign="top">Love this place, it feels a little off kilter in the picture. If it could be rotated a little to the left so the corner closest to you was parallel with the side borders, it would be solid.</td>', 'Love this place, it feels a little off kilter in the picture. If it could be rotated a little to the left so the corner closest to you was parallel with the side borders, it would be solid.', '2006-05-15 00:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
