(2416083, 332404, 37444, '<td valign="top">Very emotive - 10</td>', 'Very emotive - 10', '2006-05-15 02:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416084, 332249, 37444, '<td valign="top">I like the spires of tree and church - nicely done.</td>', 'I like the spires of tree and church - nicely done.', '2006-05-15 02:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416175, 330346, 48545, '<td valign="top">Looks nice and peaceful, here''s my 2 pennies worth, there is some granular noise in the sky that could be sorted with Noise Ninja etc, or on some cameras there is a custom setting for long exposure noise reduction.  If you look closely there is some JPEG artifacting around the spires, check the histogram to see if it combing (lots of broken lines).  Finally there is slight converging lines that can be sorted with the transform tool (however, not sure if this is allowed in basic editing).</td>', 'Looks nice and peaceful, here''s my 2 pennies worth, there is some granular noise in the sky that could be sorted with Noise Ninja etc, or on some cameras there is a custom setting for long exposure noise reduction.  If you look closely there is some JPEG artifacting around the spires, check the histogram to see if it combing (lots of broken lines).  Finally there is slight converging lines that can be sorted with the transform tool (however, not sure if this is allowed in basic editing).', '2006-05-15 03:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416242, 330072, 47597, '<td valign="top">Love the gloomy gold cloistered feeling. The pic seems to slant down on the right though, and looks quite out of focus (especially the roses). I imagine that given the dark conditions of the location, it would be very difficult to avoid this blurriness without a tripod, etc.</td>', 'Love the gloomy gold cloistered feeling. The pic seems to slant down on the right though, and looks quite out of focus (especially the roses). I imagine that given the dark conditions of the location, it would be very difficult to avoid this blurriness without a tripod, etc.', '2006-05-15 04:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416246, 331663, 47597, '<td valign="top">I like the line of surf leading my eye into the pic. However, the colours seem quite drab for a beach scene.</td>', 'I like the line of surf leading my eye into the pic. However, the colours seem quite drab for a beach scene.', '2006-05-15 04:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416253, 330804, 47597, '<td valign="top">Seems like a nice building. However, because you are not standing perfectly in the middle of the church, the one steeple is higher than the other - it''s not symmetrical.</td>', 'Seems like a nice building. However, because you are not standing perfectly in the middle of the church, the one steeple is higher than the other - it''s not symmetrical.', '2006-05-15 04:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416257, 332400, 47597, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal and wonderful.</td>', 'Very ethereal and wonderful.', '2006-05-15 04:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416273, 330320, 47597, '<td valign="top">Looks like a really dreary place. I would have increased the contrast to try and reduce the amount of greyness in the pic.</td>', 'Looks like a really dreary place. I would have increased the contrast to try and reduce the amount of greyness in the pic.', '2006-05-15 04:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416279, 332361, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the rich colouring, and the green branches around the top frame the subject nicely.</td>', 'I love the rich colouring, and the green branches around the top frame the subject nicely.', '2006-05-15 04:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416282, 332128, 58482, '<td valign="top">sucker for the clouds what can i say</td>', 'sucker for the clouds what can i say', '2006-05-15 04:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416283, 330718, 1647, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lovely building but, whilst this shot is different, it''s an awkward composition.  Do I look at the tree that dominates or the building behind it.  Other than that, colour and exposure look great.</td>', 'Looks like a lovely building but, whilst this shot is different, it''s an awkward composition.  Do I look at the tree that dominates or the building behind it.  Other than that, colour and exposure look great.', '2006-05-15 04:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416285, 332010, 47597, '<td valign="top">I find this pic pretty far off topic. I can understand the idea that some people consider sports "holy", but that concept hasn''t been captured in this pic, IMHO.</td>', 'I find this pic pretty far off topic. I can understand the idea that some people consider sports "holy", but that concept hasn''t been captured in this pic, IMHO.', '2006-05-15 04:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416286, 330800, 1647, '<td valign="top">As well as some perspective distortion (ie: top of building is narrower than bottom) - which I don''t really mind - this image looks a little rotated.  Perhaps its just the distortion tricking my eyes though.  Also, a little sharpening in an image editor would really bring this shot to life.</td>', 'As well as some perspective distortion (ie: top of building is narrower than bottom) - which I don''t really mind - this image looks a little rotated.  Perhaps its just the distortion tricking my eyes though.  Also, a little sharpening in an image editor would really bring this shot to life.', '2006-05-15 04:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416287, 332217, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the large buildings to frame the church - the contrast is very effective.  The building tops have quite a halo to them - is this a gaussian blur or the result of camera shake?  It''s a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice use of the large buildings to frame the church - the contrast is very effective.  The building tops have quite a halo to them - is this a gaussian blur or the result of camera shake?  It''s a little distracting.', '2006-05-15 04:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416291, 332199, 47597, '<td valign="top">What an amazing building! Good title!</td>', 'What an amazing building! Good title!', '2006-05-15 04:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416297, 330800, 47597, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a strong slant in the building, which puts me off.</td>', 'There seems to be a strong slant in the building, which puts me off.', '2006-05-15 04:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416308, 331031, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is cool. The distortion is a bit extreme but it kinda works. The church looks like it''s reaching up into the sky.</td>', 'This is cool. The distortion is a bit extreme but it kinda works. The church looks like it''s reaching up into the sky.', '2006-05-15 05:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416312, 332228, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. I like old churches. Too bad about the sky. I would try and expose just for that and then recompose the shot once you''ve locked exposure.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. I like old churches. Too bad about the sky. I would try and expose just for that and then recompose the shot once you''ve locked exposure.', '2006-05-15 05:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416314, 332297, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.</td>', 'Nice angle.', '2006-05-15 05:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416316, 331497, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool image. An alternate version that would work IMO would be to clone out the hair so you enhance that low key even more.</td>', 'Cool image. An alternate version that would work IMO would be to clone out the hair so you enhance that low key even more.', '2006-05-15 05:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416322, 332123, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice... Super composition. After the challenge I''d suggest you darken/clone the window in the top left corner so it matches the right side. The fact that one is brighter detracts a bit from the symmetry. Gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'Nice... Super composition. After the challenge I''d suggest you darken/clone the window in the top left corner so it matches the right side. The fact that one is brighter detracts a bit from the symmetry. Gets a 9 from me.', '2006-05-15 05:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416325, 332411, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range. The composition is excellent as is the lighting. My only problem with this is too much neatimage was applied, IMO. There''s so much texture here that I think it would have served you well not to remove. Other than that this is great. Good luck!</td>', 'Good tonal range. The composition is excellent as is the lighting. My only problem with this is too much neatimage was applied, IMO. There''s so much texture here that I think it would have served you well not to remove. Other than that this is great. Good luck!', '2006-05-15 05:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416326, 332361, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice mood in the shot. I think this might have worked better if it was cropped tighter.</td>', 'Nice mood in the shot. I think this might have worked better if it was cropped tighter.', '2006-05-15 05:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416327, 332197, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the composition however the shadows are not dark enough.</td>', 'I like the composition however the shadows are not dark enough.', '2006-05-15 05:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416331, 330934, 41337, '<td valign="top">I usually try and keep my titles no longer than the width of the image. Just letting you know since some might penalize you for the long title. As for as the image is concern, there is good interest. I''d probably bump up the saturation just a bit.</td>', 'I usually try and keep my titles no longer than the width of the image. Just letting you know since some might penalize you for the long title. As for as the image is concern, there is good interest. I''d probably bump up the saturation just a bit.', '2006-05-15 05:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416332, 331177, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very clean and colorful image. I particularly like the lighting on the front side of the church.</td>', 'Very clean and colorful image. I particularly like the lighting on the front side of the church.', '2006-05-15 05:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416333, 332404, 41337, '<td valign="top">I wish the cross stood out more and there wasn''t that large gap in the clouds but other than that the image is really good. The texture detail and color are first rate.</td>', 'I wish the cross stood out more and there wasn''t that large gap in the clouds but other than that the image is really good. The texture detail and color are first rate.', '2006-05-15 05:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416334, 332286, 41337, '<td valign="top">So wrong. :P</td>', 'So wrong. :P', '2006-05-15 05:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
