(2416398, 330464, 39880, '<td valign="top">Hey, I know that place.  I see the sign all the time, on I-70.  Nice shot.  The colors look good.  Composition is nice.   I wonder how it would look if more candles were lit.</td>', 'Hey, I know that place.  I see the sign all the time, on I-70.  Nice shot.  The colors look good.  Composition is nice.   I wonder how it would look if more candles were lit.', '2006-05-15 06:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
