(2416539, 332185, 44611, '<td valign="top">Well, I suppose to some - including my mate Gareth - yes Highbury is a holy place.  I''ll forgive you!</td>', 'Well, I suppose to some - including my mate Gareth - yes Highbury is a holy place.  I''ll forgive you!', '2006-05-15 07:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
