(2416544, 331603, 44611, '<td valign="top">A good attempt at a macro with a message.  Your composition and colours are good, but the focus needs to be a bit sharper.  Also, although I think I know what you were trying to convey here, I feel that you perhaps needed some other element - writing on the marble or a gravestone background to really succeed.</td>', 'A good attempt at a macro with a message.  Your composition and colours are good, but the focus needs to be a bit sharper.  Also, although I think I know what you were trying to convey here, I feel that you perhaps needed some other element - writing on the marble or a gravestone background to really succeed.', '2006-05-15 07:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416546, 332117, 44611, '<td valign="top">Weird background here which sadly spoils the overall image.</td>', 'Weird background here which sadly spoils the overall image.', '2006-05-15 07:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2416549, 329510, 44611, '<td valign="top">An avenue of blossom trees in the sunlight is certainly a place of reflection and peace and the composition of this is very good in the way you have the path winding away out of the picture.  The overall focus seems soft though and the greens rather oversaturated.</td>', 'An avenue of blossom trees in the sunlight is certainly a place of reflection and peace and the composition of this is very good in the way you have the path winding away out of the picture.  The overall focus seems soft though and the greens rather oversaturated.', '2006-05-15 07:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
