(2423021, 331502, 36628, '<td valign="top">There''s one thing that seems to me like it really detracts from this picture, and thats the sky, since it''s so much brighter than the rest of the picture. If you ever get a chance to go back there under the same lighting condidions, try experimenting with different compositions that exclude the sky. I think if you got closer to the flowers with the treetrunk and the hedge in the background this shot could have a lot more impact. Another thing you might try is upping the contrast and saturation a bit which would help emphasize the cemetary yard.</td>', 'There''s one thing that seems to me like it really detracts from this picture, and thats the sky, since it''s so much brighter than the rest of the picture. If you ever get a chance to go back there under the same lighting condidions, try experimenting with different compositions that exclude the sky. I think if you got closer to the flowers with the treetrunk and the hedge in the background this shot could have a lot more impact. Another thing you might try is upping the contrast and saturation a bit which would help emphasize the cemetary yard.', '2006-05-17 02:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
