(2423657, 330517, 45003, '<td valign="top">I still like this one. Not just because I was there too, but it''s quite an original photo for this challenge. I''ve taken a look at the submissions for this challenge yesterday and this one was quite remarkable. I guess some people found it too much out of the box, but you know I like photos which are out of the box ;) <br/> <br/>I wish it got a higher score, you certainly would deserve it for this one! Not only for the photo, but also for your guts. On the other hand, it''s most important what you think about it and I know you''re satisfied about this one. And you should be ;) <br/> <br/>This one tells a story and that''s why I like it so much. Well done girl! And you''re welcome. It was fun that day!</td>', 'I still like this one. Not just because I was there too, but it''s quite an original photo for this challenge. I''ve taken a look at the submissions for this challenge yesterday and this one was quite remarkable. I guess some people found it too much out of the box, but you know I like photos which are out of the box ;)  I wish it got a higher score, you certainly would deserve it for this one! Not only for the photo, but also for your guts. On the other hand, it''s most important what you think about it and I know you''re satisfied about this one. And you should be ;)  This one tells a story and that''s why I like it so much. Well done girl! And you''re welcome. It was fun that day!', '2006-05-17 05:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
