(2423905, 330595, 387, '<td valign="top">For those who asked about how I did this: It was a 25 sec. exposure. Zooming during the first ten seconds or so gives the ethereal background. The remaining time burns the foreground image more prominantly. Too bad I used the software provided by Nikon to import the photo to my PC!</td>', 'For those who asked about how I did this: It was a 25 sec. exposure. Zooming during the first ten seconds or so gives the ethereal background. The remaining time burns the foreground image more prominantly. Too bad I used the software provided by Nikon to import the photo to my PC!', '2006-05-17 06:38:41.000000', NULL, 0),
