(2424302, 332129, 43115, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry to see this didn''t do better than it did.  I was one of your 10''s, because I thought there was a lot of power and emotion behind those candles.  Maybe not enough of the DPC community knows what the candles symbolize... In any event I thought it was a very well done photo technically, that captured the emotion of a holy place, which was my criteria for a 10.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good photography! :)</td>', 'I''m really sorry to see this didn''t do better than it did.  I was one of your 10''s, because I thought there was a lot of power and emotion behind those candles.  Maybe not enough of the DPC community knows what the candles symbolize... In any event I thought it was a very well done photo technically, that captured the emotion of a holy place, which was my criteria for a 10. Keep up the good photography! :)', '2006-05-17 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2424309, 332319, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice one Rikki. Reminds me of "The Wedding Song''s" lyrics "whenever two or more of you are gathered in his name," which I''ve sung at nuptials more times than I care to mention.  The rich gold tones and perspective are perfect. Congratulations.</td>', 'Nice one Rikki. Reminds me of "The Wedding Song''s" lyrics "whenever two or more of you are gathered in his name," which I''ve sung at nuptials more times than I care to mention.  The rich gold tones and perspective are perfect. Congratulations.', '2006-05-17 09:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
