(2424571, 332129, 56405, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments! This really surprised me that it did so well.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments! This really surprised me that it did so well.', '2006-05-17 10:20:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2424584, 331259, 30364, '<td valign="top">You''ve done it again!  Unfortunately, so have the voters.<br/>A sublime architectural detail photograph that directly addresses the spiritual essence of the building.<br/>And what does it get?  Buried under twee stuff that''s barely fit to put on a biscuit tin, and comments from people who apparently seriously thought you hadn''t noticed the "blown out" highlights.  <br/>Good grief!  Happily, you appear to have a sense of humor.</td>', 'You''ve done it again!  Unfortunately, so have the voters.A sublime architectural detail photograph that directly addresses the spiritual essence of the building.And what does it get?  Buried under twee stuff that''s barely fit to put on a biscuit tin, and comments from people who apparently seriously thought you hadn''t noticed the "blown out" highlights.  Good grief!  Happily, you appear to have a sense of humor.', '2006-05-17 10:25:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2424640, 330740, 50640, '<td valign="top">I was at the Basilique last year and struggled with lighting issues. Would you be willing to share how you lit this?  Did the slow shutter speed do the trick?<br/> <br/>Thanks.<br/> <br/>Sandy</td>', 'I was at the Basilique last year and struggled with lighting issues. Would you be willing to share how you lit this?  Did the slow shutter speed do the trick? Thanks. Sandy', '2006-05-17 10:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2424657, 332426, 40580, '<td valign="top">You think "sweet" and "nice..." are helpful comments, but mine wasn''t?  Somethings wrong with this.  Next time, I''ll just comment, "nice picture."</td>', 'You think "sweet" and "nice..." are helpful comments, but mine wasn''t?  Somethings wrong with this.  Next time, I''ll just comment, "nice picture."', '2006-05-17 10:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
