(2426778, 332319, 50551, '<td valign="top">Now that is what I call an interior shot of a church! Absolutely magical, Rikki, a joy to the eye! Congratulations on the ribbon.<br/> <br/>PS there are one or two old churches here in England, too, but they don''t always appreciate photographers! ;-)</td>', 'Now that is what I call an interior shot of a church! Absolutely magical, Rikki, a joy to the eye! Congratulations on the ribbon. PS there are one or two old churches here in England, too, but they don''t always appreciate photographers! ;-)', '2006-05-17 18:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2426805, 331997, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  There seems to be too much to look at in this picture. It''s nicely composed but distant. Also, my eye seems to be drawn to the tree slash person looking thing (maybe a statue in front of a small tree?). I think a tighter crop of just the central building would have done better, IMHO.</td>', 'Trading post...  There seems to be too much to look at in this picture. It''s nicely composed but distant. Also, my eye seems to be drawn to the tree slash person looking thing (maybe a statue in front of a small tree?). I think a tighter crop of just the central building would have done better, IMHO.', '2006-05-17 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2426818, 330517, 53964, '<td valign="top">*sighhh...* I''d surfed thru'', liked this a LOT, then went back and got voting. Unfortunately, I didn''t get finished voting and didn''t hit this one :(  Sowwy,  I do love it!</td>', '*sighhh...* I''d surfed thru'', liked this a LOT, then went back and got voting. Unfortunately, I didn''t get finished voting and didn''t hit this one :(  Sowwy,  I do love it!', '2006-05-17 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
