(2427282, 331997, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>I gave this one a 5.  I think it would be much more dramatic in black and white due to the limited color naturally available.  I do rather like the centered composition as it suits this structure well.  Though it makes for unusual proportions, I think it looks better if the sky is cropped significantly.</td>', 'Trading Post commentI gave this one a 5.  I think it would be much more dramatic in black and white due to the limited color naturally available.  I do rather like the centered composition as it suits this structure well.  Though it makes for unusual proportions, I think it looks better if the sky is cropped significantly.', '2006-05-17 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427397, 330517, 22301, '<td valign="top">I thought this was great, I like to see these kinds of photos on this site because  sometimes I feel like I should only enter photos with bright vibrant colors that specifically fit what the masses will have in mind as the general concept for the challenge. But this concept is great and well done, as someone else stated your photo for holy places had a human element present and that makes this a favorite for me!</td>', 'I thought this was great, I like to see these kinds of photos on this site because  sometimes I feel like I should only enter photos with bright vibrant colors that specifically fit what the masses will have in mind as the general concept for the challenge. But this concept is great and well done, as someone else stated your photo for holy places had a human element present and that makes this a favorite for me!', '2006-05-17 21:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427447, 331870, 37893, '<td valign="top">It almost look like a long exposure to me Jimmy as the statue almost looks transparent because of the moss and the surroundings. Great shot BTW :)</td>', 'It almost look like a long exposure to me Jimmy as the statue almost looks transparent because of the moss and the surroundings. Great shot BTW :)', '2006-05-17 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427607, 331606, 38496, '<td valign="top">From CTP2:<br/> <br/>I commented during the challenge, but I''ll look a little closer Ü.<br/> <br/>I like the duotone effect in this.  It works well.  The subject you picked is good - lots of interest.  The statues at the front are sort of growing on me, but maybe if you would have included just a tad more of them, so they didn''t look so cut off?  And somehow lit them a little more so they weren''t quite as dark?  I like what you were trying to do, though, and they do give the photo some perspective.<br/> <br/>Overall a nice shot.</td>', 'From CTP2: I commented during the challenge, but I''ll look a little closer Ü. I like the duotone effect in this.  It works well.  The subject you picked is good - lots of interest.  The statues at the front are sort of growing on me, but maybe if you would have included just a tad more of them, so they didn''t look so cut off?  And somehow lit them a little more so they weren''t quite as dark?  I like what you were trying to do, though, and they do give the photo some perspective. Overall a nice shot.', '2006-05-17 22:27:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427649, 332446, 38496, '<td valign="top">From ctp2:<br/> <br/>I''m going to be perfectly honest here, so please don''t hold it against me... I didn''t like this shot all that much.  It was too dark and eerie and maybe a little disturbing looking for my tastes.  Maybe that was the effect you were going for, in which case you did a good job Ü.  Everyone else seemed to love it, though.  Congrats on the top finish!    <br/>Technically the composition and lighting are superb, and the subject is interesting, and meets the challenge.  It has a very emotional feel to it.  The composition is simple and to the point.  Well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-18 08:52:46.</i></td>', 'From ctp2: I''m going to be perfectly honest here, so please don''t hold it against me... I didn''t like this shot all that much.  It was too dark and eerie and maybe a little disturbing looking for my tastes.  Maybe that was the effect you were going for, in which case you did a good job Ü.  Everyone else seemed to love it, though.  Congrats on the top finish!    Technically the composition and lighting are superb, and the subject is interesting, and meets the challenge.  It has a very emotional feel to it.  The composition is simple and to the point.  Well done.', '2006-05-17 22:42:52.000000', '2006-05-18 09:52:46.000000', 0),
(2427663, 332349, 38496, '<td valign="top">from ctp2:<br/> <br/>I really liked this shot.  It''s a beautiful candid - well lit, well composed.  Her face could have maybe been a tad sharper.  I like the inclusion of the cross in the background, so that you can tell she is playing in church.  Personally, I think this should have scored higher, but who knows...</td>', 'from ctp2: I really liked this shot.  It''s a beautiful candid - well lit, well composed.  Her face could have maybe been a tad sharper.  I like the inclusion of the cross in the background, so that you can tell she is playing in church.  Personally, I think this should have scored higher, but who knows...', '2006-05-17 22:47:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427823, 332319, 10413, '<td valign="top">My goodness Rikki, you are racking up those ribbons.  I have been too busy with my new job to check things out here very often and was amazed to see how many ribbons you have now.  Congratulation!  This one is well deserving of top honors.</td>', 'My goodness Rikki, you are racking up those ribbons.  I have been too busy with my new job to check things out here very often and was amazed to see how many ribbons you have now.  Congratulation!  This one is well deserving of top honors.', '2006-05-17 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
