(2429161, 331711, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>nice image, probably a very spiritual place, but it doesn''t show in the photo, lighting and focus is good, but I think the composition would have been better if the doorway in the end eould have been to the far right in the image and not in the center, that way you would have shown more of the flowers and in to the arches where they are.<br/></td>', '[[trading post]] nice image, probably a very spiritual place, but it doesn''t show in the photo, lighting and focus is good, but I think the composition would have been better if the doorway in the end eould have been to the far right in the image and not in the center, that way you would have shown more of the flowers and in to the arches where they are.', '2006-05-18 08:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
