(2431251, 332319, 24642, '<td valign="top">Congrats Rikki, a well deserved ribbon.  I am amazed how well this turns out considering you used ISO 3200.  Incredible detail and this really shows of great PP skills.</td>', 'Congrats Rikki, a well deserved ribbon.  I am amazed how well this turns out considering you used ISO 3200.  Incredible detail and this really shows of great PP skills.', '2006-05-18 19:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
