(2437752, 332294, 10818, '<td valign="top">This shot may benifit from contrast, maybe some curves.  I like the shot, and understand why people are offended...but I dont think they have the right to be rude.<br/> <br/>I think you knew there would be some backlash, so its no big deal.  You are talented, you will get a ribbon soon I am sure.</td>', 'This shot may benifit from contrast, maybe some curves.  I like the shot, and understand why people are offended...but I dont think they have the right to be rude. I think you knew there would be some backlash, so its no big deal.  You are talented, you will get a ribbon soon I am sure.', '2006-05-19 20:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
