(2453938, 329801, 41574, '<td valign="top">I saw this shot in the contest, but wasn''t able to comment on it. It''s a great "animal portrait," but I don''t get the title: Why does the self-proclaimed new-born wish to be taken to "the holy place" ("heaven")? Is it suicidal? ...</td>', 'I saw this shot in the contest, but wasn''t able to comment on it. It''s a great "animal portrait," but I don''t get the title: Why does the self-proclaimed new-born wish to be taken to "the holy place" ("heaven")? Is it suicidal? ...', '2006-05-24 17:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
