(2507157, 332446, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club. <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Very Nice shot. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Very good composition.<br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>I really like the subject. Nice take on the challenge. <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>Colors are so wonderful. Green and purple in the BG goes very well.<br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>Only thing I can think of is the blown highlights on the face. The face is not looking very clear. It''s either OOF or blown out.<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Over all very nice.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your top 10 placement.</td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club.  First Impression Very Nice shot. Composition: Very good composition.Subject: I really like the subject. Nice take on the challenge. Technical (Colour and light): Colors are so wonderful. Green and purple in the BG goes very well.Improvement: Only thing I can think of is the blown highlights on the face. The face is not looking very clear. It''s either OOF or blown out.Summary: Over all very nice. Congratulations on your top 10 placement.', '2006-06-11 20:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2522683, 331606, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Nice shot. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Nice angle shot. I don''t know if it was possible to include more of the statues.<br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Very nice, fits the challenge<br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>I reallt like the duotone effect and lighting is perfect. <br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>If it was possible to show more of the statues.<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Nice over picture meeting the challange.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.</td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. First Impression Nice shot. Composition: Nice angle shot. I don''t know if it was possible to include more of the statues.Subject: Very nice, fits the challengeTechnical (Colour and light): I reallt like the duotone effect and lighting is perfect. Improvement: If it was possible to show more of the statues.Summary: Nice over picture meeting the challange. Keep shooting.', '2006-06-16 14:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2527752, 332446, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>CPTII, oi!</b> <br/> <br/>Very cool shot, sir. It looks very much like a digital painting -- which is a compliment, by the way.<br/>The <i>great</i> colour duality and the dramatic lighting make this a winner in my book. My favourite for the challenge.</td>', 'CPTII, oi!  Very cool shot, sir. It looks very much like a digital painting -- which is a compliment, by the way.The great colour duality and the dramatic lighting make this a winner in my book. My favourite for the challenge.', '2006-06-19 04:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
